        StaticItem("Von Königsberg Silver", "A 1 Kilogram ingot of pure silver, complete\nwith the imprint of the Königsbergs.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Net", "", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("Alchemist's Fire", "One of the great feats of alchemists.\nAlchemist's fire is to many known as\nfire in a bottle, an unstable concoction\nwhich brusts fire in every direction\nonce releaced. Dangerous to both\nenemy and thrower alike, as there is\na high chance of the volatile bottle\nexploding still in your hand.", "minecraft:splash_potion", ""),
        StaticItem("A Blooming Orchid", "A freshly picked Orchid, recently bloomed and\nsmelling of a lovely vagrance. Beautiful to\nthe eyes, this, like every other, was a truly\nspecial flower. Gifted from one to another, a\nsymbol of somehting that will never wilt.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Blooming Orchid", "Arcane I\nOnce and forever more, a blooming orchid\nwhich seems never to wilt, a gentle\nglistening glow to it's delicate petals.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("A Blossomed Orchid", "An Orchid, blue in stature, and plucked from\nthe fields of Dragur, lies blossomed in the\npalm of your hand. Gifted from one to\nanother, the beautiful flower appears freshly\ncut.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Crumena's Orchid", "A pristine, shimerring blue Orchid, freshly\npicked and encased in a finely crafted wooden\nbox. The flower appears to be in bloom, and\nthe box intricately decorated with beautiful\nspirals and the like. Engraved in the inside\nlid of the box reads: Time passes, but Lilies\nbloom.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("An Unwilting Orchid", "To match and adorn those of it's ilk, this\nblossoming and beautiful Orchid is encased\nwithin a glass vial, a certain glow\nilluminating out from it's central point as\nthis vibrant flora appears to be undying in\nnature.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Fur Coat", "For those cold Krugmas nights...\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Deleted Email", "Legend has it this was recovered by the\nDwarven whistleblower, \"Assangegoth.\" With\nhis efforts, Ski_Kings corruptions was\nbrought to light on 11/9/16.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Red_Rockkit.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Doll", "A doll with brown locks and green eyes, her\ncomplexion is fair and looks quite lovely!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:rabbit_hide", ""),
        StaticItem("Ring of Mylas' Lover", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HI3_.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Earrings", "A pair of dazzling earrings that have a\nsilver chain hanging downwards low with a\nteardrop contoured diamond.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Valentine's Heart", "A golden, heart-shaped object, clearly made\nby an expert jewelsmith. The aurum that makes\nup the mayority of the body is polished\nuntill one can see their reflection in it. In\nthe middle of the elegant heart lies a\nsimilarly shaped ruby, which shines brightly\nwhen held in light. The heart is attached to\na small, gold chain, so it can be worn as an\nelegant necklace.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LordRoberto.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Baby Rattle", "This rattle would be fun for an infant to\nplay with, perhaps causing some stimulation\nfor a while. It's near perfect shape shows\nthat it was likely made by an experienced\nwoodworker. \"To a bright future\" is carved\ninto its handle.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hiebe.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Saffvil", "A sickly green grass.\nThe smell of death wafts around it", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("The Juggernaut's Chestplate", "An extremely rare, and high quality carbarum\ntop, crafted by an expert smith. The Carbarum\nis forged into an effective armor, complete\nwith gorget, neck protectors and pauldrons.\nIt reaches down to protect the front of one’s\nlegs as well. Attached upon the golden chest\nplate is a small golden plate, with an onyx\nlion, indicating who sold it. The carbarum\nplating would make it near impregnable to\nmost weaponry, with a few exceptions.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Malinor.", "minecraft:diamond_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Ferrum Warhammer", "Special Ability: Bone Break\n20% chance on full hit to cripple target.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Carbarum Battleaxe", "Special Ability: Shield Break\nDisable an opponents shield on successful hit.\nWhen in main hand:\n-3 Attack Speed\n+9 Attack Damage\n+48% Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Rope Oil", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("A Mammoth Tusk", "A brilliant white tusk from a large mammoth.\nThe bone is large and heavy, even an adult\nwould struggle to carry it around easily. The\ntip is extremely sharp while the rest is\nsmooth and flawless.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
