        StaticItem("Raven's Talons", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tirenas.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Cactus Black", "An intense hallucenogenic strain of cactus\ngreen created by Vecirok, noted by its black\ncolor. Once smoked, the world would begin to\nspin and bend, with colors growing intense\nand vibrant. Even the most experience of\nsmokers would find this experience\nbreathtaking.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Orange Present", "A strange box that gives off an odd aura to\nthose who hold it. It is incapable of being\nsmashed or pried open, regardless of the\nstrength or magical prowess of the person\nattempting. What rests inside of this box is\na mystery. Perhaps one day it will open?\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNoodle.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Daemon Steel Blade", "A beautifully forged weapon that obtains a\nhilt of pure aurum; at the end of which\nhandles a resin sphere containing of many\nloose gems within. The circular object being\nheld down by ornated hooks. It must be\ncrafted by an immortal themselves with such\nan alluring appearance!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
