        StaticItem("Tome of the Woodworker", "Brimming with raw knowledge.", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Tome of the Farmer", "Brimming with raw knowledge.", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Ironwood Bow", "A well made ironwood bow, meant to fit\nKaryssmov specifically. It is carved with a\nwhite stang encassed around gold dust. It\nwould be difficult for anyone but the\nintended user to hold.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JadePetal.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Seaweed", "A clump of seaweed. This tangled mess seems\nnearly impossible to unknot. Don't let your\nhair get caught in it! Some tell tales of\nturning such into a frozen treat!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Youthful Lubba Scale", "A sizeable scale of the Lubba, a powerful sea\nserpent. The scale is blue-green in nature.\nWhile extremely light it also seems to be\nquite durable. Perhaps it could be used in\ncrafting something.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Faroean Stag", "A necklace with a silver chain, pendant being\na finely shaped aurum stag. It shimmers in\nthe sunlight, the nobility of the creature\ntruly showing when held up to the sun's\nglare. It shows a deep friendship from those\nfrom the House Faroe, gifted upon only the\nclosest of allies.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by K0llu.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Blood Soup", "Ever wanted to live on nothing but\nliquid for the rest of your life? Here is\nyour answer. One vial can provide you\nwith a days worth of energy.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Kary's Fearsome Halberd", "In your hand lies a halberd. The pole is made\nof fine, polished wood to prevent\nsplintering. The head consists of, on one\nside, an axe, for unarmored foes, on the\nother, a spiked hammer, perfect for beating\nup armored opponents. On the end, is a sharp\npike, like a spear. On the other end, a\nsingle sharp end rested, usefull to be\nplanted in the ground for extra support. The\nweapon is long enough to be used against\nfootmen and cavalrymen alike.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LordRoberto.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Oliver's Spear", "A spear hewn from ancient stones, somehow\nhoned to vorpal effectiveness in the hands of\none feral enough to resonate with its stoic\nsavagery. Once it was a lone scythe in fields\nof repugnant briar, the tool of\nmany-a-monster's reckoning. It whispers of\nits old master, and the battles it saw\namongst Mordring's woods.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Oliver.", "minecraft:stone_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("The Gem Tome", "A leatherbound tome, with latches and a\nkey-lock to keep it from being opened easily.\nUpon opening, it is a tome bound with many\nsparkling mana gems, eleven pages. When one\npage was touched for at least five seconds,\nand when the user was close enough to the\nbook, a memory would be transmitted to said\nuser. It was fairly heavy, and quite thick.\nNothing interesting upon its cover. [[ This\nbook cannot be copied, for more information\non each memory, or the item. Contact\nVioletPepsi or Cybering ]].\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by NailmasterSpiffy.", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Tinkerer Kalen's Crank", "What, did you expect\nFood or something? Do\nI look like a chef or something?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HI3_.", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("Islebone Helm", "This is a set of superiorly-crafted bone\nboots. It is encrusted with sea-salt and\npowdered silicate, and studded with pearls\nand lobster shell. The object is decorated\nwith giant squid beak, giant crayfish shell,\nand raenkelp.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:chainmail_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Islebone Leggings", "This is a set of superiorly-crafted bone\nleggings. It is encrusted with sea-salt and\npowdered silicate, and studded with pearls\nand lobster shell. The object is decorated\nwith giant squid beak, giant crayfish shell,\nand raenkelp.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:chainmail_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Islebone Chestplate", "This is a superiorly-crafted bone chestplate.\nIt is encrusted with sea-salt and powdered\nsilicate, and studded with pearls and lobster\nshell. The object is decorated with giant\nsquid beak, giant crayfish shell, and\nraenkelp.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:chainmail_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Sword of Thorns", "This recipe discovers the item\nSword of Thorns", "minecraft:map", ""),
        StaticItem("White shield", "Craft together with a banner\nin your 2x2 matrix to\nadd patterns.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Lorraine Cross", "A holy Lorraine cross in the form of a\nnecklace lays before you, it'd be glistening\nwith pioustivity. All proceeds go to the\nChurch!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Geomancers Javelin", "", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Cadbury's Egg", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken Contraption", "Found in the Dwarven Deeproads, does it hold\npower? Probably not.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.", "minecraft:stonebrick", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of Air", "A staff capped with blunt golden steel heads\non both ends and a grip in the middle. The\nrune of Air would be engraved on both ends\nand would be straining to be released\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shadowlord57.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Shreck'Lak Limited Edition Action Figure", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Hawk Talon", "A talon from a giant hawk. Roughly eight\ninches long, this talon belonged to a\npredator of the skies. It could possibly be\nmade into something or hung as a trophy.\nBeware, it's sharp!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Multicolored Feather", "A rather large bird feather. The pattern is\ncolorful and tropical. It's size and\ncoloration would match that of the birds that\nlive on Ceru.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Hawk Feather", "The large feather belonging to a Giant Hawk.\nThese quills once served as a tool to soare\nthe skies. It's underside is soft like a\npillow but its edges are brutally sharp.\nCareful!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Dagor's Rock", "This rock seems to be LIT with something\ncalled \"meams\"! Several words are imprinted\non the artifact, including \"support him for\nskygod\" and \"incest\". Should you come into\ncontact with it, the \"meams\" overpower you.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Suspicious Orcish Brownies", "A brownie made by the company of Eath'Lur.\nExactly. It appears to be a multi-layered\nbrownie. It's covered by a very small amount\nof some sort of dust, and, amidst the layers,\nthere's one of chocolate and another one that\nseems to be thin and and of a deep purple,\nand there's also a weak smell of mushrooms.\nIt makes the user both drowsy and awake,\ngiving off some sort of disturbing effect,\nwhile the same person in question\nhallucinates, which makes it highly\naddictive.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Gusmarzku.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Hochmeister Mirtok Poseable Action Figure", "A POSEABLE HOCHMEISTER MIRTOK ACTION FIGURE,\nCRAFTED DETAILS. GO BACK TO THE DAYS WHEN THE\nTHIS!", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("La Chaleur du Foyer", "A standard edition of ale, bottled and\nrefined using a small blend of hops. Although\nit’d suffer from a slightly bland taste, it’d\nstill leave a hearty and strong taste upon\nthe tongue. Its bottle is marked with the\nl’Vienne crest.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Pandann.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Doc's Soul Sand", "The last of the old halfling named 'Doc'.\nThis is his pure essence, his very soul,\ntrapped...", "minecraft:soul_sand", ""),
        StaticItem("Idol of Metzli", "This rather peculiar object appears to be\nnothing more than a whittled down bone, upon\nfurther inspection of the object it would\nseem to be an Idol of Metzli adorning the\nphrase, \"To Metzli we pray.\" along the soft\nbut solid bone base.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by KetchenX.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Boots", "They go fast! Because they're Red!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ambduscias.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Sturdy Iron Ring", "A noble ring rimed for only the sturdiest,\nstoutest workers. Its shine is everlasting,\npolish seeming almost holy. It serves as a\nreminder of the obligation and ethics of the\nhard-working working class.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nani Kaphiri.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", "")
    )

