        StaticItem("A Emerald Statue", "This statues appears to be a maiden made out\nof emerald, for fertility.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DukeOfEdge.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Helm of Knoxmas!", "The pumpkin helm reeks of evil!\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Day Lilies", "A bouquet with colors as warm\nand bright as the summer's\nsun. Typically given to one\nwho could use a bit of cheer.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Perfectly Polished Pristine Pillars", "One would think such pristine pillars would\nhave become marred and rough over the years,\nbut not these! Due to perfect polishing\ntechniques, these pillars shine and glisten\nas they stand strong against the test of\ntime. May such traits represent one's\nfeelings for another as they stand against\nthe challenges and tribulations of the realm,\ntogether.", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Violets", "This type of bouquet would\nbe given to those in a newly\nformed relationship, to signify\nthe mystery and excitement of\nan uncharted journey together.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Roses", "A traditional bouquet of roses\nthat would communicate a\nstrong and powerful love\nfor the recipient.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Hibiscuses", "To give this bouquet to someone\nwould signify a desire to develop\na deeper friendship or possibly\na relationship.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("A Bucket of Ripe Manure", "Ugh! What is that smell?! Oh, a bucket of\nmanure. No wonder. The bucket would be\ncrudely made with a simple handle. The manure\nwould be quite ripe and thick, almost as if\nit was freshly collected. It'd be a horrid\nevent if this was accidently spilt on a\nnoble!", "minecraft:bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("A Slightly Rusty Helmet", "A helmet with a slight coating of rust. Yet,\nwith some elbow grease, it shines up quickly.\nIt would appear, though, to be about a size\ntoo large, often causing it to fall into the\nwearer's eyes. The smell of the sea seems to\nbe trapped within it.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Helmet", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dewlox.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Leggings", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dewlox.", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Boots", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dewlox.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Heavy Carbarum Spade", "When in main hand:\n-3 Attack Speed\n+5 Attack Damage\n+30% Attack Damage\n+4 Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("The Blooming Orchid", "Just as one would often expect, the brilliant\nand budding Orchid remains present and lively\nthroughout any and all days. A truly\nbreathtaking display.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Sun Effigy", "A golden token, fashioned in the shape of a\nfacebearing sun. Its expression is warm and\nkind, and bids the remembrance of the\npleasant feeling of sunlight.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Idolomun.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Warhammer", "Special Ability: Bone Break\n10% chance on full hit to cripple target.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Snow Plough!", "Shovel snow with super efficiency!\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Rare Conch Pearl Necklace", "A strand of hand selected pale pink conch\npearls with a 18k white gold braided clasp.\nExpertly round cut diamonds accentuate each\nlink of gold between the pearls.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MrLollytime.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Feather of Calming", "The feather seems abnormally soft to the\ntouch. When grasped, a warmth like no other\nconsumes you. You feel utterly calm.\n*Moderator Approved*\ni_am_Ricky approved this item.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("An Ardent Locket", "A beautifully decorated and styled locket,\nengraved with stylish trimmings and lines\ndetailing various symbols. The locket, silver\nin colour and locked with a clasp, is bound\nto a silver chain.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Spirit Magnolis", "The plant is long with short leaves.\nA bit rough when you pass a finger\nthrough it, and very hard to crush\nand tear. Replanting it in another\nplace is impossible.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by CosmicWhaleShark.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Homing Shard", "The large, glasslike gem has no immediate\neffects, but one may notice that it\nbegins to glow a bright yellow when\npointed at a very specific angle\ntowards the north. This angle\nseems to point north and\njust west of modern Salvus.\n*Moderator Approved*\nCombustionary approved this item.\n((Contact Combustionary to interract!))", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Hat", "A merry reminder of our most\nfestive of holidays!\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern's Pocketwatch", "The little watch would be hung by a detachable chain.\nIt is of a gold metal, with the clock face's hands\nmade of copper. An image of a beast would be detailed\ninto the back, its barbed tail filling its viewer\nwith an odd sense of power and security.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Pet Slime", "This little slime is rather corrosive - or\nwas. Now, he's quite docile, with small\nlittle teeth and arms. He has beady red eyes,\nalways glaring at you cutely.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Harrrison.", "minecraft:slime", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Lorraine Cross", "A magnificently beautiful golden cross\ncommissioned and crafted by the Holy See of\nthe Canonist Church.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Autumn Dust", "A nut-sized fire-opal nestled within a ring of\ntarnished silver, its iridescent hues of blue\nand red seemingly cast forever within the stone.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("T A C O", "The rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("~The Magic Coal~", "Through magical means wood was broken down\ninto coal by passing a whole stage\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HI3_.", "minecraft:coal_block", ""),
        StaticItem("mmmmmThe Awesome Starmmmmm", "Hey you! Yea, you. You're awesome.\nStay awesome, have fun.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Arockstar26.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
