        StaticItem("Large Chimera's Talon", "", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Star compass", "The dark metal framed compass rests snugly in\nyour hand. The insides, whilst lackingany\nmarkings, shows something of a constellation.\nTapping the top of it issues an image to\ndisplay above the glass showing the black\nheavens and its starry glory.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Harrrison.", "minecraft:compass", ""),
        StaticItem("Maiden's Reprieve", "The lute is highly elegant, it curving to fit the figure\nof a woman just right. Its wood is of a dark stain, a\nbeautiful deep and dark mahogany. If strung by those\nskilled of hand, it will produce a sound that strikes\nlonging into the hearts of even the manliest of men.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:fence", ""),
        StaticItem("Behemoth's Spar", "A long staff carved from the bone of an\nimpossibly large beast. A plethora of pale\ngems are embeded down its length mingling\nwith unnerving etchings of Al'Tahrn Durngo.\nThe gems are enchanted to create a multitude\nof spectacular illusions.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by IDontCare_Bear.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Parion Tahn'thill's Ashes", "The urn of Parion Tahn'thill; the inscription\nreads: Parion Tahn'thill. A good citizen,\ncouncillor and Sohaer to Haelun'or. A\nmali'aheral who served the populace until his\nlast breath; loved and missed by many. May he\nforever rest in peace. Maehr'sae Hiylun'ehya.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern's Blood", "A vial full of dark red substance.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RammerJammer73.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Courlandic Dreadknight's Crusher", "Taken from a dreadknight that fought for\ncourland in the Battle of the Rothswood, this\nis a true goliath of a weapon. Those who are\nstrong enough to use this mace could crush a\nman like a grape. It possesses an eerily dark\ncarbarum alloy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hero_Prodigy.\nWhen in main hand:\n-3 Attack Speed\n+5 Attack Damage\n+49% Attack Damage\n+0 Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Haelun'or Master Key", "A key which looks quite beautiful, and seems\nto be made up of a lovely silver, however it\nfeels wooden and unbreakable. It seems to\nunlock any door in Haelun'or. [If going to be\nused, contact 'RideTheSky']\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("The Unlit Scepter", "", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Music Box", "A delicate little music box, small details carved into\naged wood. When opened, soft music would fill the air,\nmaking its listeners feel safe and at home.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:noteblock", ""),
        StaticItem("Jerry's Lottery Ticket", "*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Oriental Fan", "A beautifully crafted work of art, depictions of tsunamis cover it's folds.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Makayla Cuth'arlin.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Astral shard", "A piece of one of the three astral constructs. It's white marble\nsurface shines brightly in the sun.\n*Moderator Approved*\nTilly037 approved this item.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Salted Pork", "Some say it's the saltiest pork ever made, perhaps seasoned by Aengoth's salt.\n*Moderator Approved*\nAengoth approved this item.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Cookie!", "Delicious!\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Harvest Cake", "A caked baked from the harvests of the season.\nTo enjoy with apple cider or friends.\n*Moderator Approved*\nMorsmordre approved this item.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Magical Flower", "The flower seems to emit a whisper upon\nholding it, and will act as if it is waving\nin the wind... even if there is no wind! ((PM\narockstar28 to interact))\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Frozen Spear", "A warped spear, with intricate blue carvings set along the\nheft. It appears to double as a walking stick.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ImCookiie.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Lionna's Violin", "A violin from Aegis. The letters\nSG are engraved upon the finely\npolished dark oaken wood.\n*Moderator Approved*\nGigarun approved this item.", "minecraft:tripwire_hook", ""),
        StaticItem("Pocket Watch", "", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Luminous Cloak", "Peculiar lines of runes trace their way about\nthe shoulders and hem of this robe. When\nidle, they're entirely gray and seem to serve\nnothing but aesthetical purpose. However,\nwhen worn the runes shine brilliantly in the\ncolor of their user's aura. The light is\nfaint, and likely unable to do much else than\nserve an aesthetical purpose.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _Cyrris_.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Medallion", "A pumpkin shaped, inexpesive piece of gold.\nAwarded to those who complete the Witch's Maze.\n*Moderator Approved*\nMorsmordre approved this item.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("A Scandalous Portrait", "A well poised portrait, a commissioned\nartwork of Crumena Izalith. Upon the canvas,\nwith his chest bare and standing atop a rock\nwith a sword drawn against the sky. Fighting\na giant lion while lightning strikes the\nbackground, his hair flowing in the wind.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by A Famous Artist.", "minecraft:painting", ""),
        StaticItem("Explosive Pumpkins", "Pumpkins packed with explosives.\ntic..tic...tic... BOOM!", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Spooky Treats", "A chewy candy that tastes oddly like pumpkin pie\ndespite it's sickishly green color.\n*Moderator Approved*\nMorsmordre approved this item.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HI3_.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruibrium Tinted Cake", "The cake would be quite delicious, however tinted with\nthe highly addictive Ruibrium, ohmy.\n*Moderator Approved*\nPandann approved this item.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
