        StaticItem("Carrot Juice", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Allergy Remedy", "A tightly packed jar of dried herbs, with a\nlabel denoting its purpose as an\nanti-allergenic remedy. Should one chew just\na pinch of the herbs within, they would soon\nfind an anti-inflammatory effect...\nParticularly in the lungs, eyes, nose, and\nother such places commonly effected by\nairborne allergies. They seem particularly\neffective in warding against allergies to\nspores.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Solace Locket", "What appears to be a lovely locket hanging\nfrom an aurum chain, upon opening it one\nwould discover the elaborating painting of\nThe Aurora Borealis' with breath-taking hues\nof crimson, green, and purple.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Melia.", "minecraft:painting", ""),
        StaticItem("Sealed Thanhic-Powered Icebox", "A sealed box that is used to keep food cold,\nusing the power of Thanhium. The Thanhium has been\nproperly sealed to keep the food toxin free, but\nas a concequence only raw food types can be put inside\nsafely.\nBrought to you by Greg Corp. [TM Greg 1541]\nGreg Corp is not responsible for possible\ninjuries, thanhic poisoning, or fatalities that may occur\nwhile operating the device.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("The Warhammer", "A huge warhammer, longer and thicker than the\naverage one. Measuring about 8 feet tall, no\nnormal human can weild it. It seems to be a\nperfect fit for ologs.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by OldTortoise.\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.8 Attack Speed\n+5 Attack Damage\n+50% Attack Damage\n+2.5 Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Laurel of Leaves", "A strange druidic energy seems to envelop\nthis headpieces, preventing the leaves from\never decaying. A headpiece that once was\nowned by a Druid that gave their life to save\nmany. It is believed the previous owner would\nhave wished for its wearer to embody the\nheroism they once showed. When a gentle\nbreeze washes over the wearer, the smell of\nfresh leaves and herbs fills their nose.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Mental Ward Ring", "Magic Resistance II\nArcane I\nAn arcaurum ring encrusted by innumerable\nsmall flawless diamond gemstones, each\nsparkling beautifully in the light. Should\none wear this ring they will be shrouded in a\nT3 ward against mental intrusions. Has a\nlimited set of energy and must be recharged\nafter the ward is used. [PM Gladuos for\ndetails]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Disguise Kit", "A portable kit that opens up to reveal\nseveral dozen vials and bottles. They are\nlabeled for either eyes, hair, or skin, along\nwith the color. A small booklet is tucked\ninto a sleeve and provides instructions on\nhow to use the dyes. The eye dye lasts a\nyear, the hair dyes last 3 months, and the\nskin dye lasts one month. There is also a\nbottle of solvent that can be added to water\nto remove any of the dyes. A powder labeled\n‘Hair Growth’ is included with instructions\nto mix it into aqua vitae.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Clockwork Butteryfly", "A piece of extremely intricate clockwork in\nthe form of a butterfly. It has blue,\ntranslucent crystal wings gilded in silver.\nThere is a tiny clock key on a delicate chain\nattached to the body, which fits into a pin\nsized hole on the back. When turned,\nminiscule gears inside the body turn to make\nthe butterfly’s wings flap in a slow, steady\npace. The body is made of silver and is\ninlaid with several tiny sapphires. The\nentire object is about 4 inches across when\nthe wings are fully extended.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aislin.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Mutton Soup", "A savory, delightful bowl\nof Mutton soup.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:mushroom_stew", ""),
        StaticItem("Tythus's Rex Size Triple Beef Burgers", "Divine beef burgers\nbought by embezeling\nthe donation pool.\nAt least they tastes good!\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Ma'amoul", "These beautiful cookies are perfect for\na special occasion. Delicate shortbread with\ndate filling. Traditional Farfolk baking.\n(Recipe created by adamc2000)\nFood: 4\nSaturation: 3.0\nExpires in 9d 16h 46m", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Austere Whetstone", "A simple, blocky whetstone of basic quality,\nused for sharpening various blades and\nknives. An intrinsic item, useful for any\nwhose profession revolves around a blade.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:brick", ""),
        StaticItem("Oliver's Box", "Arcane I\nIn your hands sits a Golden Box, a Cleric\nblessing can be felt should one with the\npower check, On the top sits a simple line of\ntext \"The Mighty Oliver\". inside the box, a\nGolden book sits, also blessed which holds\nthe Ghost of Oliver, trapped within. ((PM\nGallic to interact))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ser Gray Kellian the Third.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elven Katana", "The ancient aurum blade is well crafted and\ndecorated.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blueberry Cactus", "A dark green and frosted cactus with\ntrichomes buds. It is known for its\nsmooth blueberry taste.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice Kiss", "A minty tasting powder that is very cold\nand chilling to the touch. Just the auroma\nprovides the holder with a chilling sensation", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Wine", "Red wine is a classic among many\nsophisticated individuals, the more aged it\nis the better it becomes.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
