        StaticItem("Bag of Chocolate Truffles.", "A small bag of small chocolate spheres with a\nslightly hard shell and a softer inside.\nDespite the name, these candies are completly\ndevoid of truffles, yet the sentiment of the\nname is enough to be dispensed by the truffle\nseller.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Roughspun Linen Cloth", "A rolled up square meter of roughspun linen,\nmade from dried flax. Though it may not feel\nespecially nice to the touch, it is a\nsurprisingly hardy cloth, that can take alot\nof strain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Embroidered Damask Patch", "A one foot long square of embroidered blue\nlinen, this patch of cloth has had a great\ndeal of effort put into it, embroidered with\nthe designs of gold filigrees.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Burn Healing Salve", "Murky green slush that moves slowly\ninside the vial. Upon application, your skin\ntingles cooling slowly.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
