        StaticItem("x Herbal Tea x", "An ancient Druidic recipe\nderived from the tomes of\nthe Grove's library.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet Ale", "Adding a fruity ingredient to pale ale\nwill improve on it's taste.\nWith melon, it becomes sweet.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Crouching Feather", "The results of brewing an\nherb in a base. Further\nbrewing may be required\nto complete the potion and\nenhance its attributes.\nIncrases natural eyesight for a short time,\nallowing the drinker to see better and farther,\nespecially at night.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Elf's Hair Vine", "The results of brewing an\nherb in a base. Further\nbrewing may be required\nto complete the potion and\nenhance its attributes.\nThis brew gives you a minor energy boost.\nWill suffer a crash afterwards,\nbecoming very tired.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Infernal Rod", "A sturdy, 1'6 wand like object carved from\nwhat appears to be draconic bone A large\nfiery hued topaz would rest at one in within\na carved dragon's maw - Two smaller rubies\nresting in either eye socket which would take\non a fiery tint upon activation. The objects\nlength would be carved with a scale like\npattern, and its grip crafted from tough\nWyvern hide. Should one utter a certain\ncommand the rod would let loose a great fiery\ntorrent from the topaz at its end within a\nthree meter range!\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Larihei's Fingers", "The results of brewing an\nherb in a base. Further\nbrewing may be required\nto complete the potion and\nenhance its attributes.\nDrinking the brew makes one more\naware of their movements, able to do\nthem more accurately.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Crimson Vase", "The results of brewing an\nherb in a base. Further\nbrewing may be required\nto complete the potion and\nenhance its attributes.\nLowers the drinker's inhibitions,\ncausing them to act brash & bold.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Linseed Oil", "A small, squarish bottle, filled with a\nbright orange transparent liquid. A single\nlabel on the front reads ⓁⒾⓃⓈⒺⒺⒹ ⓄⒾⓁ. The\nflax-sourced oil inside bears a somewhat\nhearty taste, though it is surprisingly\nflammable. It seems well suitable for\nanyone's oil based needs, whether cooking,\noiling, or setting things aflame.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Ticket", "With this simple piece of parchment, you can\ncollect and gather up to partake in a\nsplendid event within the Adelburg Festival!\nSee how much you can get, and gather in\nexchange for a splendid prize.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ♕ The Imperial Administration ♕.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Coconut", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
