        StaticItem("Trinket Of Light", "A large gemstone held in place with a golden\nframe, with various orcish looking symbols\ncarved into the metal. Should one rub the\ngemstone in a cetain way, it would release a\nrather bright pulse of light, able to\ndisorient those about the user momentarily.\nFarseers feel off-put by this trinket, pm\nLhindir_ for more information.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kurag.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Illusory Pendant", "An intricate pendant composed purely of\nmagegold with a flawless diamond encrusted in\nits center. A shimmer is seen ever so faintly\nover its surface. When one wears this and\ntaps its gem thrice, a glamor will be cast\nover their features so that they resemble a\nginger man. Will last for a day [1 IRL hour]\nbefore being drained. Will recharge after\nabout a week so it may be used again. [7 IRL\nhours] [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
