        StaticItem("Campfire kit", "Excellent for the construction of campfires.", "minecraft:flint_and_steel", ""),
        StaticItem("Fi'annyer il'mayilu", "The wine would appear red in color, and have\na big taste, that hits every section of your\nmouth with flavor, specifically it’s rich\nwith a fruity taste, and aged to perfection.\nAfter the fruity taste hits your mouth, it\nleaves an interesting aftertaste that never\nseems to be consistent. The bottle reads\n“Fi’annyer il’mayilu 1512” It’s over 100\nyears old. By reading the back of the bottle,\nyou grasp that the name means “First dance\nwith your lover.” in the Archaic tongue of\nthe Elves.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
