        StaticItem("Bubbles", "A light brown gerbil with a white belly. He\nsqueals, he steals, he climbs, he squirms:\nhe's your typical rodent. Normally he rests\nhimself in Richard's pocket although\nsometimes when he's feeling cocky, he'll peer\nhis head out.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
