        StaticItem("Greymane's tusk", "This sizeable tusk is roughly the length of a\nlong sword, ending in a crudely sharp point -\nwell suited to pierce and puncture flesh,\nmust have been carved from a large beast!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Skylez1.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Simorgh feathers", "Bright crimson feathers, beautiful and\nluxurious. They shine and reflect when\nexposed to any form of light, as if slick\nwith an oil. It's long... Seems to be around\neight inches in length.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Minotaur horn", "", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Far Oxhorn", "This is a masterfully crafted ox bone horn.\nIt is decorated with native gold and black\nsilver, and encirlced with bands of ox\nleather and dolphin leather. Eagle bones\ndangle from it on ox leather string. On the\nitem is an illustration of an ox and a stag\ndoing battle.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Pendant", "A beautiful, golden pendant in a teardrop\nshape. It is simple, yet elegant. on a part\nof the pendant is an engraving: Sutica 1591.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MorriSaye.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Candle", "A wax candle, dyed a deep velvet. When lit,\nit produces a gentle aroma of roses and\nstrawberries, creating a rather romantic\nfeeling.", "minecraft:stained_hardened_clay", ""),
