        StaticItem("Set of Wooden Dice", "Four wood dice, each with 6 sides. Oddly\nenough, instead of small indented cirlces,\nthe dice is indented with the number 1\nthrough 6. The dice are set within a small\nwooden cup with a tiny lid, kept on with a\nred string wrapped around it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:beetroot_seeds", ""),
