        StaticItem("The Conservatoire Stamp", "A golden coin, the edges of the token formed\ninto an octogon. The front of the coin has an\nillustration of a book and quill inscribed\nonto it. On the back, a large \"C\" is carved,\nand under it, the phrase \"Scientia est\nPotentia\" is scribbled.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("[H] Golden Skull", "God knows why someone\nwould cast a golden skull, but hey!\nIt's worth a pretty penny. [DO NOT PLACE DOWN]\n*Moderator Approved*\nfreema5 approved this item.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Kraken Fang", "This blade is enchanted with the abillity to\nbe recalled to its master's hand. The blade\ncomes with a stylized gauntlet which works in\ntandem with the sword and must be worn for\nthe magic to work. Both are set with matching\nemeralds that glow from time to time. The\nsword must have a direct and clear path to\ntravel and can only be recalled from up to 50\nfeet away.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Emperor_Zufelt.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Pelt", "The slightly-tattered pelt seemed unlike\nanything from common beasts nowadays. It\nadorned sleek brown and crimson colours\nacross the rough fur. The underside of the\npelt had various indecipherable symbols\nwritten and carved across it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Remains of Ish'Urkal", "A few, ashen strands made of a strange\nsubstance, cold to the touch, they always\nseem to be wanting to flutter free, any\nshaman near would feel a presence of dread.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jentos.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Cannoli", "A delectable custard wrapped in a hard,\nsugary exterior crust. Despite its difficulty to\neat, the flavor is infinitely rewarding.\nFood: 9\nSaturation: 8.0\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dewlox.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Grey Present", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidsgiving Cornucopia", "The horn-shaped cornucopia was quite light\ndespite the many delights resting within.\nCarefully woven from dried plant fibers, the\ntraditional container was decorated in an\nassortment of autumn leaves with a treated\nleather strap allowing it to be carried. It\nexuded the scent of a druid. Laying within\nwas an ever-refilling variety of delicious\nnuts, fruits, and vegetables to appease even\nthe fattest dwarf in the realm.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Spice Latte", "You'd best have your yoga pants on when\ntaking a sip from this pumpkin-scented coffee\ndrink! With a hint of cinnamon, nutmeg, and\nclove to add to the milky-pumpkin flavour,\nyou feel the breezes of autumn pass your skin\nat each sip. Metaphorically of course.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Turkey Plushie", "A medium-sized toy crafted with excellent\ncare and attention to detail. It had the\nscent of autumn across its soft surface. The\nperfect toy for any child. Or any adult too\nfor that matter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Homemade Dulce de Calabaza", "These delicious treats are made by first\ncutting, peeling, and deseeding a pumpkin\nbefore chopping it up into small pieces to\nboil. Brown sugar is then stirred in to water\nwith a mix of cinnamon, poured over the\npumpkin pieces, then boiled again. For at\nleast a quarter of a day after that the\ncovered pieces soak up the syrup. They are\nthen boiled one final time before being\nallowed to dry out for at least half a day.\nTo finish it off, they are sprinkled with\nsugar!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Renn.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Sugared Cranberries", "Perfectly-ripe cranberries that were boiled\nin water with a half cup of sugar, soaked and\ncooled for one elven hour before draining,\nthen rolled in another half cup of sugar on a\nbaking sheet. Afterwards, they are dried for\nfour elven hours. An amazing sugary sweet!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Renn.", "minecraft:nether_wart", ""),
        StaticItem("Aged Druidic Gravy", "The oddly savory sauce was perfect for\nanything .. at all! Aside from the hint of\nstrange herbs floating across the sauce's\nsurface, the gravy had some peculiar\nproperties. It seemed to enhance the flavour\nof anything it's poured upon. Whether that be\nyour husband's horrible cooking or even an\nolog's armpit!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet, Sweet Potaoes", "These juicy peeled sweet potatoes are first\nbaked, cooled, then mixed into a concoction\nof sifted sugar, margarine, milk, cinnamon,\nalmond extract, and vanilla extract.\nAfterwards, this mixture is kneaded until\nsmooth with added coconut bits, shaped into\nsmall ball-like formations, dusted with\npowdered sugar and finally refigerated in\nyour local thanhium cooling unit!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Renn.", "minecraft:beetroot_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Insta-Corn!", "Concealed within a small, tied leather pouch\nwere a dozen enhanced corn seeds. When one\nuse of these seeds made contact with raw,\nhealthy soil they would sprout a 2x2 patch of\nmatured corn within a minute. The taste of\nthe juicy fruit was unbelievable.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Butterbeer", "A large mug of premium foaming butterbeer,\nstraight from the druidic breweries! The\ndelectable beverage had the taste of sweet\nand welcoming butterscotch. With only a mild\nalcoholic potency the drink was perfect for\nany occasion.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Salted Chicken", "Food: 5\nSaturation: 0.0\nExpires in 24d 20h 29m", "minecraft:cooked_chicken", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodsap", "This is sap taken from a bloodseed tree. It\nsmells of iron and sugar, and tastes\nunpalatable. It is sticky to the touch, and\nstains a dark red. A faint energy persists in\nit, but it slowly fades, and by 1641 will\nhave faded completely.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
