        StaticItem("Vrogak's Warmask", "This menacing mask....\nBelonging to the Iron Rex, Vrogak'Gorkil,\nit is made out of Scaddernak skin\nand designed to fit around his face and tusks.\n*Moderator Approved*\nVladovAlt approved this item.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
