        StaticItem("Tall Grass", "A group of Savoyard pikemen were so\ndisciplined in battle that they gathered the\nattention of the Duke himself. He made them\nmembers of his personal retinue and ordered\nspecial weapons fashioned for them. Their\nmovements, perfectly synchronized and their\npikes swaying like blades of grass in the\nwind earned them their weapons the moniker of\nTall Grass' among the Savoyard populace.\nThis 16 feet long pike ends with a beatifully\ndecorated steel head, its metal engraved with\nleaf motifs carved directly into it. The\nshaft is wrapped in green leather.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Darksalvo.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Chestplate of St. Edmond", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Tome of Spit Fire", "A gold-fletched tome of dragonhide bound\npages. Upon the cover is etched a dragon\nstanding tall on its hind legs with wings\nspread outwards.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
