        StaticItem("Bow", "The bow, rigid and straighter than most, is\nmade of a blue-tinted wood and inlaid with\nthanhium and gold, forming a pattern that\nresembles a dragon. Inlaid also is a sentence\ndenoting it as having been created by Serelia\nIheiuhii'ante for Althin Drakon.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Arockstar26.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Shield", "A large ethereal white gem is hidden behind\nthe shield, powering the enchantment. A ward\nspell is weaved into the shield against\nMental Magic, Sensory Illusion & Evocations.\nA sturdy shield fit for combat against a\nplethora of magics and man alike.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
