        StaticItem("Velvet Took's Chopping Axe", "A pristine carbarum axe, cleaned and shaved\ndown to perfect smooth sides. The handle\nwould be a mix of oak and dark oak, with\naurum laced in spiraling up the entire\nhandle. The pommel would have VT + TS etched\ninto it, with redstone dust filling in the\nletters. The axe head would be double sided,\nand have intricate patterns etched into it.\nThe axe would be very small in size compared\nto normal axes, it would be clear this is a\ntool made for a Halfling's ease of use.", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("True Frontier Farmer", "Carbarum hoe very small in size clearly meant\nto be used by a halfling. It would have\nredstone and aurum etched along the handle\ncurved around it, with VT + TS etched into\nthe carbarum", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
