        StaticItem("Strange Bat Plushie", "A large, near-perfect replica plushie of a\nHallow's Eve bat. It was complete with floppy\nwings, wide ears, and large glass eyes that\nhad an eerie amount of realism to their\nfeatures. You swore it moved out of the\ncorner of your own eyes.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Booger in a Jar", "A fragment of an Ooze that lurked Linandria\ntrapped in a glass jar. It occassionally\nmoves.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Hallow's Eve Pumpkin", "A sinister grin was etched across its\nterrifying features, with eyeless sockets\nthat burned into the center of your soul. The\npumpkin never succumbed to rot or disease.\nThough as it was held, you could sometimes\nsee piercing red eyes staring at you out of\nthe corner of your eye.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Rose", "A small black rose that never wilted or\nsuccumbed to disease naturally. The rare\nplant was blessed by the forests. Small wisps\nof pale green mist jumping between each petal\nand leaf.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Moon-Kissed Candle", "A pale wax candle that burned endlessly atop\na small golden candle plate. The flickering\nflame was a soft blue color though didn't\nseem to offer any warmth or heat. It didn't\nburn others and only itself for eternity. If\nyou put your ear to it, whispers would seduce\nyou into mindlessness until you pried\nyourself away.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:redstone_torch", ""),
