        StaticItem("Brothers-in-arms", "The Cross guard of the weapon says 'Brothers\nin arm' on both sides. Small direwolf teeth\nare placed on at the ends of the crossguards.\nThe pommel shows a grey Direwolf head. The\nsword would be 144 cm (45 inches)", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Scales", "The scales are very strong, and are almost\nimpenetrable. They can be used for a number\nof things; making tools, weapons, clothes, or\narmor. It is a great trophy for a person who\nhas aided in the attack!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Wyvern.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Fart Gag", "When filled with air at one end, you place it\nunder a person before they sit to let out a\nloud fart noise.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by IDontCare_Bear.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Soul-Bound Item", "Save this for the end of the dungeon to\nrecieve a reward.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by freema5.", "minecraft:ender_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Nether's Wrath", "A terrifying concoction which is prone\nto melting glass, so a stone containment\nwould be required for this liquid. Due\nto how bright this smooth running\nconcoction is, it would be painful to\neven look at. Nether knows what it\nwould be like if one were to touch it,\nlet alone drink it.\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Pyromaniac", "A potion known and feared for it's\nability to melt through skin and muscle.\nThis liquid would be of a lava like texture,\nand upon air contact, it would set itself\nalight, the flames however being weak.\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Foncefeu", "It's a simple but well-made steel sword,\nhand-and-a-half in length. The crossguard has\na golden Lorraine Cross on both sides. The\nhandle is wrapped in soft black leather, and\nthe rounded pommel has a piece of glowstone\ninlaid onto it which gives off a soft yellow\nlight. The blade has an accompanying sheath\nof matching black leather and steel accents.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Brew of Harmony", "A marvelous concoction of a light green hue.\nIf drank, it cleans the stomach of toxins and\nacids, making the person feel relaxed\nand well feed. It can also be used to purify\nthe outside of the body, this liquid many\ntimes used to clean alchemy ingredients\nand precious gems.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Vileblood", "An affronting mixture of thanhium and aged\nblood, this raw poison displays a deep black\nin expression of the death it's only meant to\nbring. The \"potion\" is perpetually cold, and\nthe copious amounts of toxic dust present\nwithin assures it may make a watersource or\nbloodstream ill, if not lethal, with a single\nbottle's worth.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantSoup.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Orchids", "Usually given to one who\nis already in a relationship,\nthis bouquet would signify\nthe desire to keep a long lasting\nand stead relationship.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Dismounting Arrow", "", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Dale's Trousers", "A pair of pants which, despite how harshly\none might scrub, would eternally stink of\nfish and the insides of a Skelt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Valmir__.", "minecraft:leather_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Recruit's Boots", "Standard issue Chambery Marine chainmail\nboots", "minecraft:chainmail_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Hairpin..", "You hold in your hands a Strange Hairpin, the\nhairpin is constantly damp and fashioned from\na feather. You get a cold sensation travel\nthrough your body when holding it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by White_Wolf.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Baby's Brain", "A liquid made of cactus green that can\nmake even an archmage feel like a baby.\nIt's the baby's life for me.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Teeth of the Verminae", "Teeth as long as daggers\nand as sharp as blades.\n*Moderator Approved*\nBrandNewKitten approved this item.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Daydreamer", "A briljant wooden craft standing at about 5\nft tall. The tip is curved to a circle where\na webbing is spun to fill the formed circle.\nBeads and feathers find themselves entangled\nwith the mandala shaped dreamcatcher. The\nlower end is carved into a sharp point. These\ndecorations fit the name of both staff and\nwielder 'daydreamer\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Roo's Dank Green", "A special recipe made with a variety of\nexotic herbs.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Charred Notes", "These notes reflect something odd and eldritch being\npulled forth. Perhaps a horror, of kinds?", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Sutican Horse Armour", "Pried from the cold dead corpse of a\nSutican's horse.. Someone of stature\nobviously, though vein quite obviously.. Who\nwould parade their horse around in this?!", "minecraft:diamond_horse_armor", ""),
        StaticItem("A Dead Sutican's Sword", "The sword of a coward, one who fled from\nbattle and paid the ultimate price.. An\narrow to the back of the head.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Red Wine", "This Bottle of Red wine, would be aged as\n1556 Amber Cold\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Omega_Gene.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Le bisou de la sirène", "The wine is a deep, almost blood red and is\ncreated using the Lotharingian style of\nmulling, it’s labeled “Le bisou de la sirène\n1589” Which translates roughly to “The kiss\nof the siren.” according to the back of the\nbottle at least. The wine tastes good, and\nthe fruity taste begins big, then quickly\nfades into no taste at all, and leaves you\nwanting more.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fork", "What... What do you expect it looks like,\ngenius?", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Edgy Shreck'Lak Action Figure", "", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Shreck'Lak Flavoured Ice Cream", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:ice", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice Cream Cone", "A delicious pearly white mound of vanilla ice\ncream sits in a cone! Yummy!", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Pine Seer's Rootbound Staff", "Four sets of pine roots spin to entangle each other, bark unevenly covering\nfragments along its rigid pose. At the head of the staff would be three thick buch\nof pine needles spanning from a few branches. Pinecones littering its head as well.\nIf in the hands of a Druid while casting, their magical focus would be heightened\nslightly in terms of speed.\n*Moderator Approved*\naerialkebab approved this item.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider in a Jar", "Trapped within the glass jar was a Black\nWidow spider, the spider was alive, but\ndidn't appear to be happy. The spider would\nconstantly be trying to attack the person\noutside of the jar.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Qalasheen Dates", "Chewy and delicious, a small dried fruit.\nLike sugar but better.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Rugged Bark", "I lay face down,on a branch leagues above\nthe ground. Down far below me are those who\ncrave monumental powers, now i see that it is\nthe force which devours. They claim to be\nthose who serve, but I know they murder and\npillage with lusty verve. The ground below is\na splendid shade of brown, I wonder what it\nwould feel like if I just fall down. They say\nwisdom is born from experience, from wisdom I\nknow the best path is to follow with\npersistence.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Senor_Tortuga.", "minecraft:wooden_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Spinner", "The object would consist of a peculiar\nbearing in the center of three extensions,\neach at 120 degrees out from the center. At\nthe end of each of these, a lighly pulsing\nred gem would rest that when spun, would\nrelease a trail of arcane wisps!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:wooden_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Turtle", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cernunnos' Hunt", "A combination of Cedarwood and Cinnamon\nBrandy, with a few other ingredients produces\nthe well renown Cernunnos’ Hunt. Contained\nwithin a rectangular bottle, with its nozzle\nplugged by a cork, the substance is a\nbronze-esque hue, with a fierce scent to it,\nindicating the sheer strength of the brandy.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cerridwen__.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cerridwen’s Light", "A scarlet substance inhibits the smooth\nbottle of wine, with a thick scent\nreminiscent of pomegranate and rosemary,\nmixed together to produce one of the most\ndelicious wines to date. The mixture, working\nso brilliantly well, has earned the ire of\nwinemakers from the four corners, with its\nexact recipe dating back to an era\nunbeknownst to we, mankind. Fanatics would\ndub it the drink of Mother Cerridwen.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cerridwen__.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Plumpkin", "This pumpkin is large, weighing a heavy\nthirty pounds. A bright orange in color, this\npumpkin was grown with care.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Tortoise Statuette", "A statuette of a tortoise, crafted from\nflawless emerald. The shell of the tortoise\nhas a variety of swirling patterns carved\ninto it. One would notice that the entire\nstatuette shines in the sunlight, due to it\nbeing crafted from emerald.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The_Shrouded_One.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Plush Toy", "The small stuffed toy represents a piglet.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Purple Dress Boots", "These walking fashion icons are sure to make\nthe wearer arrive in style. Made from a high\nquality leather, the boots are stained a deep\npurple hue. A pair of shoes like these are\nsurely not to go unoticed. The name 'Ellie\nis etched into the side of each of the boots;\nperhaps the owner?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by August.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("God Diploma", "Anotherday's god Diploma", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven's undying love!", "The reciever of this item has recieved\nElven's love for christmas <3\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheElvenMage.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Rixym's Bone Staff", "Runes would be carved down the length of the\nstaff!", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Karake Paste", "A thick paste farmed from the bones of\nskeletons and opiate powder. Has its own\nunique kick.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ghul Ash", "The charred ash of a deformed Ghul, killed\nin the sewer system of Sutica. It was\ndestroyed during the cleansing of the sewers\nwhen the Love Stone was discovered.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LumberjackMack.", "minecraft:gunpowder", ""),
        StaticItem("Treads of Distant Fortune", "These sturdy and well-made boots seem to be\nable to handle many miles! On the inside a\nsoft wool is present to make sure that the\nwearer's feet a nice and warm. The outside is\nalso reinforced with extra leather for\ndurability, whilst still looking on-trend and\nfashionable.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by August.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Bowstring", "A length of bowstring, made of intricately\nwound fibers of hide and sinew. It has about\n100lbs (~45.4kg) of draw weight.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tavern_Roleplay.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Carbonated Water", "Nothing short of lavish, this bottle is\ntinted pink and ornamented with shaped\ngarnets. The effervescent drink fizzes\ndelightfully in the mouth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Roses", "Floral graced by GOD, distributed on 5th of\nThe Grand Harvest, 1608; The day Callixtus\nthe I and Najila Shadid joined in wedlock.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Church of the True Faith of Old Believers.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Frozen Thorns", "", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Prevaricator's Staff", "This magical staff is decorated by a hand\ngrasping at a deep blue gemstone orb. It\nappears to be enchanted in such a way that\nwhen it’s bent far enough, it will break.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Lone Tree News is looking for people to contribute their work!", "Jaya Jayamen ((Sofetios)) is looking for\nwriters, artists, journalists, and others to\nhelp contribute to The Lone Tree News with\ntheir work! Send a bird to Jaya Jayamen\n((Sofetios)) for more information.\nContributors get part of the profit.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Stone Lance", "A lance designed to dismount\nother horse riders while on horseback.", "minecraft:stone_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Wholesome Grain", "This wholesome grain seems perfect for making\nbread! You can smell a strange odour coming\nfrom the grain and it's been tinged with a\nslight brown colour, it must be the fanciful\nspices right? [[Contact drfate786 if\ningested]]", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Azrela", "A flute with a emerald shining in the middle.\nIt would be decorated with many tropical\ncolors. The letters \"Akklo\" would be carved\nunder the emerald.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Senor_Tortuga.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of 25yr. Herendulian Whisky", "This bottle of whiksy would be covered in\ndust, and if opened, would have a peaty\nalmost earthy smell to it. This aged whisky\nis almost unheard of in the land of Axios\nanymore.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rainbow Fish", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dog Plushie", "A doggie plushie!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Begotten.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("18 Year Remembrance Token", "A token, that signifies the celebration of\nthe 18 year-long war between the Dwarves and\nOren.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Chimaera's Talon", "", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Hide", "The hide of a green orc, the skin is\ncovered in strange runes that once glowed\nwith power\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aengoth.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Cursed Demon-Rabbit's Foot", "", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Cloth with some wine on it", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by DukeOfEdge.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Perfume", "A delicate, round bottle easily rests in your\npalm. The smooth, glass outer layer is\nstained turquoise: a similar colour to the\ndivine fragrance encased within. The bottle\nemits a pleasing aroma, smelling of fresh\nlavender.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Godric var Ruthern.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Forever Snowball", "A perfectly round snowball that never melts\nor loses its form. Whatever magic holds this\ntogether is a true Krugmas mystery.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MorriSaye.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Edelweiss", "The flower is pressed and imbued, so as to\nstay 'fresh' ad infinitum. It is a rare\nmountain flower, which usually grows atop\nmountain peaks and is very hard to find.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Butter Biscuit", "Fat and sweet, it's so adictive.\nFood: 2\nSaturation: 1.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Gem Encrusted Battle-Axe.", "A double headed, peculairly light battle axe\nwith a large ruby resting between its two\nheads. It'd have a series of odd carvings\nrunning along either side of the metalic\nheads - Should a certain command be uttered,\nthese carvings would light up a bright\nyellow, before the axehead would begin to\nspew electricity in all directions.. More\nthen likely enough to paralize a human\nsoldier on contact with their metalic armor\nor flesh.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lhindir.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Pungent Decoction", "A rusty red liquid with a light orange hue,\nthis brew has a warm, discomforting\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Electrum Ingot", "*Moderator Approved*\nFyaaheart approved this item.\nA refined whitish gold alloy with few imperfections\nin it's surface, dark creatures would find it painful to the touch", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Throwing Dagger", "A dagger used to throw or harm as a\nprojectile. Used notably by Aerolun Cyredaer\nvia telekinesis.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ankathia.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Custom Wax Seal", "A simple tin seal for purpose in putting a\ndesign onto a dollop of wax. It is adorned\nwith the design of a small bird, facing\nupwards to the left with its wings at its\nside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Metá to xífos", "A bastard sword of considerable length, 40\ninches in size. The normal leather handle of\nthe sword had one emerald infused into the\ncenter, giving the sword a slightly weird\nfeel to it. Starting from the bottom of the\ngrayish-steel sword, beautiful etched runes\nlined the blade. When the correct phrase was\nspoken, flames would wreath the blade. 2\nemotes to fully build-up [[ Contact\nPurpleCola for more info ]]", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Eternal Leaf", "This leaf seems to have healing properties.\nJust the touch of it gives a person a\ncalming feeling.", "minecraft:waterlily", ""),
        StaticItem("Fortune Cookie", "Written in fine penmanship inside of the\ncookie, it holds the lettering of: \"You will\nbe given the gift of love.\" on the golden\nparchment.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Violino.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Witchhunter Shirt", "+3.0% Magic Resistance", "minecraft:chainmail_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Sutica's Heart", "The gem was found in the oasis in Vailor, a\nmerchant held on to it and travelled with it,\nhe treasured the gem and kept it safe for an\nage. When he left the city of Sutica he left\nit hidden, the gem is old and fragile yet\nprecious and expensive.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Serpent Eggs", "The egg has a hard green casing. The shell is\nsoft and smooth yet feels powerful.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("sord with aids", "Special Ability: Sweeping Strike\nWhile standing still or sneaking deal small AoE damage", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("123 Fabled Boots of Wrynn 123", "These fabled boots were hand-stitched by\nWrynn himself in the Forge of Creation\nknown as August’s Boots. If one were to\nwear these boots, they would feel a power\ncourse through their veins as Wrynn would\nwatch over them.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("F*ck-Me Boots", "These tall boots spanning up the wearer's leg\nwould make anyone want to f*ck them. Some\nwould call the wearer a slut, but what's\nwrong with a little company?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by August.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Work Boots", "Work boots fit for making other boots! They\nare mainly used by August when he walks\naround his shop creating boots for the\nmasses. Although they may be old and worn\nthey still have some life left in them...\nsomewhere!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by August.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Dress Boots", "Fashionable boots indeed! Wearing these boots\nwill for sure catch some attention. Although\nthey may not be the best for long journeys\nthey look most on-trend and in style, an\nexcellent choice for an upcoming dance or\nball. The shoes although being stylish still\nfeel comfortable to wear!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by August.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Spiked Wyvern Tail", "A chopped off tail of a Bull Wyvern. The\nsharp spines sticking out of it still glint\nin the light.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Cyan shield", "Craft together with a banner\nin your 2x2 matrix to\nadd patterns.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Lime shield", "Craft together with a banner\nin your 2x2 matrix to\nadd patterns.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold-studded Cowl", "+6% Magic Resistance", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Shogging Tournament Trophy", "A wooden, carved pumpkin to commemorate the\nShogging Fest of 1572.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ever.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Staff", "An excellent but\nunremarkable walking stick.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Salted Food Crate", "A salted crate for food containment.\nClick on this item with uncooked food in your cursor to store.", "minecraft:piston", ""),
        StaticItem("Set of orange-red feathers.", "A set of two orange-red feathers.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Hawk Meat", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:chicken", ""),
        StaticItem("Key of the Wood Elves", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:green_glazed_terracotta", ""),
        StaticItem("Head of an Undead Lur Wolf", "The skull would seem to be from a Lur Wolf,\nthe jaw well built made from strong and\npowerful muscles. Being ment to tear apart\nmeat it would be armed with a dangerous set\nof teeth, still sharp to the touch. The Skull\nwould seem to still be in the color of a\nbleached white. While the top of the skull\nwould appear to have a slash across it, the\nback of its skull also being somewhat\nchipped.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Scimitar", "The word \"Hisuan\" is engraved on the sword's\nblade.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Fay's Pan Flute", "A small hand crafted pan flute, fit for a\nchild. Its tubes are attached together using\nmany metal clasps. The tubes themselves were\ncreated from bamboo, and small carvings were\nimprinted onto the wood. The flute is also\ndecorated with a variety of colourful\nfeathers, beads and bands, each of them\nbearing their own special pattern, or print.\nThe name “Fay Aendryr” is printed on its\nside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BreadstickKazoo.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Fish Cakes", "Despite its misleading name,\nthis dish actually lacks fish any sort of fish.\nA fish-shaped cake filled with a sweet custard.\n(Recipe created by 3___3)\n+2 health\nFood: 2\nSaturation: 3.0\nExpires in 2d 1h 32m", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Basilisk Venom", "A bottle of basilisks venom held securely in\na thick glass vial specially treated to hold\nit. The liquid within held a green tint,\nacting like acid to most material.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Saint's Grace", "Feeling envisioned by a saint only happens\nto holy men. Or does it? Drink this potion\nand feel the raise of your heartbeat, and see\njust as if you were high... up with god.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The graceful potion", "White wisps flow in the liquid of the potion,\ndancing like a petal in the wind.\nDrinking it makes you move more gracefully.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fast relaxant", "After hard work, a sip of this potion will\nmake your body drop in relaxation.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Mushroom Poison", "This thick swirling liquid contains flecks of white\nsimilar to the ingredient used to make it. Once it is drunk\nthe drinker would suddenly feel the sensation of an\nupset stomach and nausea.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Drunken Lords Secret", "You hold in your hand a small glass bottle\nfilled with an aqua blue liquid, it glows\nwith an ethereal blue bue. A warm sensation\nis felt throughout your body as you hold it\nand if one were to drink the liquid contained\nwithin, they would become intoxicated rather\nquickly.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by White_Wolf.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Biggun Treats!", "Food: 6\nSaturation: 6.0\nExpires in 1d 20h 12m", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("The Miss Pumpkin Crown", "A beautiful pumpkin crown created by Sutican\njewelers!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Angmarzku.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Duster of Cleaning", "A seemingly delicate but sturdy duster with a\nsmall gem inlaid in tha handle, when tapped\nthree times a small gust of wind builds up in\nthe duster and releasing it in whatever\nmanner the user needs, not enough to push a\nman over though.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("SandRipper Painting", "A painting displaying the orcish monster, a\nleviathan of a worm seen to be slaughtering\norcish cubs and folk alike. The color is\nstrikingly vivid, and the blood appears to be\nreal.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DivineJustice.", "minecraft:item_frame", ""),
        StaticItem("Cyan Halsworthian Flower", "A Flower Sprouted In The Beautiful Fields Of\nHalsworthy . Picked My the Finest Gardeners\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bahbou123456.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Thanhic egg", "This egg has had the yolk and white sucked\nout by a determined individual. It has been\nfilled up with thanhium dust. I wouldn't\nrecommend eating one...", "minecraft:egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Tankard", "The sides of the mug are ornately decorated\nwith etchings of glorious battles and vibrant\nfeasts. What draws your eye is the thin ring\nof runic symbols that ring the edge of the\nmug itself. Try as you might, you cannot seem\nto spill the contents but you have no problem\ndrinking. The piece is truly of Arcadian\nmake.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("The Silver Pie Dish", "A wonderful pie dish worked with beautiful\nsilver detailing.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murdervish.", "minecraft:bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Bracelet", "A braclet of beautifully carven gold, laden\nwith studs of bright, glistening emeralds\nthat seem to glow when held near the light.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Crown Pumpkin", "The small pumpkin would have a large grimace carved into it's face. Were one to look\nat the pumpkin, it would remind them of Lord Knox, the same features upon the pumpkin.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
