        StaticItem("★ Goblin Caramel ★", "An egg made by hard-working goblin slaves to\nbring you the best that chocolate with\ncaramel can offer. But since you don't know\nit was made by slaves, it doesn't matters at\nall since it tastes good. Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
