        StaticItem("Maroon Draconic Ichor", "The thick blood of a wyvern, infused with the\nproperties required to make draughts and\nbloodsteel, among other things. Should it be\nused to do so within a short time of its\ndeparture from the being it once flowed\nthrough. (Expires 2017-11-1)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Moose Antlers", "", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Bokolo", "A red bokolo plushie that would look a lil\nbit angrier. The red bokolo tend to be rather\nfierce, and this plushie would have larger\ntalons than the others. (A fan favorite of\nEcaeris's)\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Baby Bottle", "", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Cider", "Alike its counterpart, the glass has been\nrefined to imitate your stereotypical Witches\nvial. Ripe with an orange substance that too,\nbubbles consistently with an alluring mixture\nof cider and pumpkin extract; truly, a\nmasterpiece of the Halloween spirit. This\ncider was brewed, bottled, and labelled by\nthe avant-garde Saelian of Linandria.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rabbit Plushie", "A small cute plushie of a rabbit with its\nlimbs open wide for a big hug! Two big black\nbuttons are sewn in for the eyes, and a\nsmaller one for the nose. A fluffy tail lives\non the back, providing an irresistable, soft\ntouch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Starfelt.", "minecraft:rabbit_hide", ""),
        StaticItem("Exotic Avian Feather", "A bright red feather from a large avian\ncreature. It's quite beautiful and might make\na good decoration for someones hair. The\nfeather carries with it a very fruity smell.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by White_Wolf.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber Wolf Fur.", "Amber wolf Fur..Held up by a long Iron\nHook..They would glow brightly..the color of\ntheir glow matching the Furr, Orange, with\nWhite markings..The Fur had been claimed by a\nSmall hunting party..each neatly cut into,\nMaking perfect Pelts for above a fireplace,\nor maybe made into a lovly Hood,\nHowever..unless taken care of, If one with\nbare skin were to touch the fur..they'd feel\ntheir hands burn..as if they stuck their\nhands into a pile of burning thorns..\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TakKumn.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Western Khorghul Flowers", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Angmarzku.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
