        StaticItem("Skull of ElfenLie", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Atheros", "A root, two feet in length, harvested from\nthe jungles of the Kha' lands. The root\nitself sports grey and brown spots, and\nserves as a pain reliever.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Mana-Infused Giant Raven Feather", "These enormous feathers were quite beautiful\nin appearance. Miniscule voidal energies\nlingered along its dark-coloured length,\nthough nothing dangerous.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("A pretty emerald", "It's a very nice emerald. It's perfectly\nshaped, and it shines brightly in light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gusuminister.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Majestic Red Feathers", "You hold in your hand Majestic Red Feathers,\nthey once belonged to the mighty Crackers the\nRavenous! Devourer of Food. Perhaps you can\nuse it as decoration, or fashion from it a\nquill?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by White_Wolf.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("⋞Ｂｌｕｅｂｅｒｒｙ Ｋｏｍｐｏｔ⋟", "A small, squarish jar, filled with preserved\nblueberries suspended in liquid, its contents\nsurprisingly sweet. It bears a label on the\nfront saying ⋞ Ｂｌｕｅｂｅｒｒｙ Ｋｏｍｐｏｔ！ ⋟ along with\na subtext saying: \"⒢⒪⒪⒟ ⒡⒪⒭ ⒮⒠⒭⒱⒠, ҢѲҬ ⒪⒭\nᛕᛜᛁｄ!\" in bright white on a painted on red\nbanner. It has a checkerboard patterened\ncloth lid, witha tight string around to keep\nit fastened on.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Panda Necklace", "The chain of the necklace is made of gold!\nThe colour vibrant and pure! At the bottom of\nthe necklace is a large emerald that has been\npainstakingly carved into the shape of a Red\nPanda. The animal appears to be sleeping,\ncurled up tight with it's eyes closed.\nEncompassing the gemstone, to hold it in\nplace, are golden leaves and branches. When\nthe light catches the stone just right, it\nappears that the stone beams with life!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZipZapMan.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Bundle of Orchid Stems", "A large bundle of orchid stems, dried, and\ntied well witha yellow ribbon. It has\ninstructions on it to grind up into powder\ncalled salep, and than place into a hot water\nto thicken it, add sassafrass and create a\ndrink called saloop.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Cool Murky Potion", "A murky concoction made of a swamp herb\nand frostvine. It tastes thick and slushy. Your whole\nbody would protest against drinking this.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Amethyst Necklace", "A silver necklace with an inlaid black\namethyst that seemed to absorb any light.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Hand Mirror", "A light blue tinted mirror surrounded by a\nring of silver waves with the head of an\nalluring naiad crowing it. The handle is\ncasted in the shape of a mermaid's tail -\nexquisite detail brings a certain elegance to\nthis simple belonging.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Starfelt.", "minecraft:glass_pane", ""),
