        StaticItem("Blessed Holy Lorraine Cross", "A golden holy Lorraine cross, blessed by the\nVicar of GOD in the virtues of the Saints.\nThe cross is magnificently detailed and\nshines bright in the light of the sun. The\nbeholder's faith becomes the center of\nattention when worn.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Beardweed", "With beardweed, anyone can have a GLORIOUS\nbeard, Even womanly elves and unholy traps!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AstartesTemplar.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Elegantly Dark Oak Crafted Flute", "The object before you is an elegantly flute\ncarved by a skilled woodworker from dark oak\nwood. Carvings of flowers, vines, and other\nvegetations are used as decoration thought\nthe wood, the flute itself skillfully sand\ndown for a soft and smooth feel. When used,\ncan produce lovely tunes if played right.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Archipelego.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
