        StaticItem("Herendulian Cigar", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Heavy Leather Treads of Dark Illusions", "Jet black boots stare uncomfortably at you,\nthe colour to them appears to shimmer\nslightly as if it were not actually there.\nThe stitching holding the boots together\nseems to be fine and elegant, making them a\nfine pair of boots for almost any type of\nactivity. However something does seem off\nabout these boots.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by August.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Lorvihk's Walking Boots", "These boots are perfect for walking long\ndistances! At the seams, reinforced leather\nis placed to give them an extra lick of\ndurability! The insides of the boots are\ncoated with a thick fur to make sure the toes\nand feet are sung during cold seasons! On the\nside of the boots, the phrase 'Property of\nLorvihk Filsdr'ottr' is etched into the\nleather.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by August.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Porkour's Meat", "Expires in 1d 17h 13m", "minecraft:porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Sealight", "This is a finely-crafted spotglass flask\ncontaining sealight. It is a gel consisting\nprimarily of water and collagen. The remnants\nof Turgon Algae within the gel produce a weak\nphosphorescence for a few minutes after\nexposure to the sun.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:sea_lantern", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Flute", "A simple but well-made iron flute.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Totem Stake", "A 9 Inch stake with decorative leather wraps,\nwings sprouting from the sides, a wooden cap\nand a sharpened tip that would be great for\nimpaling into the ground. The totem would be\nready to be carved into and decorated so as\nto represent any spirit.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Jandy_.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Frontier Farmer", "A hoe forged by Taliah Sintel, made with\nperfectly forged bluesteel. Only the most\nelite of Halfling farmers could handle this\nhoe. It would have VT + TS carved into the\nlower grip.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Brooch", "A silver brooch inlaid with sapphires.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Wrist-mounted Flame-spewer", "An almost entirely magegold gauntlet, with a\nnozzle and canister mounted on top of it.\nUpon activation, a thin stream of flame will\nrapidly spew from the nozzle. Five block\nrange, four emotes from activation to firing,\nlasts two emotes, one charge.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Metal Glove", "A small metal glove that seems to have holes\nin the fingers for multiple mana crystals.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Skull", "A decapitated Goblin head, taken from a\ngoblin tribe in the Deeproads.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elven Pot", "This is an exceptionally-crafted fired\ncavemud pot. It is studded with acacia,\nredwood, and diorite, and is encrusted with\nhepatite. It is encircled with bands of woven\naqua hen grass, and woven sawgrass. It is\npainted with herb-fungus dye. On the item are\nillustrations of elves. The elves are\nperforming labors, including woodworking,\nfarming, and alchemy. On the item is an\nillustration of Malin and Iblees. Iblees\nappears terrified. Malin is posed\ntriumphantly.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Bones", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
