        StaticItem("Inscrutable Key", "This is a masterfully crafted obsidian key.\nIt is decorated with rose gold, and encircled\nwith bands of hepatite and copper. It is\nstudded with black bronze. The key glows with\nan ethereal blue light. It is heavy in your\ngrasp. On the key is an image of a menacing\nelf in obsidian armor.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Malin's City.", "minecraft:ender_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Fragments of a Pot", "These are the fragments of an\nexceptionally-crafted fired cavemud pot. They\nare mottled and scratched, some have been\nworn down to nothing. They are tinged green\nand white from moisture and sun exposure.\nFaded herb-fungus dye can be found on the\nfragments. The remnants of indecipherable\nillustrations can be found on the fragments.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Whale Bone", "Once part of a big, proud beast, this\nbleached bone has since been removed from its\noriginal position.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Darksalvo.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Whalebone Dagger", "A Dagger, sharpened and crafted from the\nbones of a Whale. Carefully shaped and\ngrinded down, the edge of this makeshift\nblade has come to a sharp point.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Whalebone Coronet", "A coronet fashioned from whalebone,\ntraditionally worn by the Lord and Lady\nBaruch\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Brokenhelix.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Winter's Chalice", "Arcane I\nAn ornate goblet made from a purely refined\nelectrum alloy. The metal itself is hued a\ncreamy gold, and it's encrusted with a couple\noblong-shaped fine rubies. Anyone using this\nvessel may find all drinks within are always\nrefreshingly cool. Amber-colored shimmers of\nenergy manifest inside the gemstones on\noccasion, indicating a magical presence. [PM\nGladuos for details]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Its_Over_Anakin.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Spooky Pie", "Beware! You've been spooked!\nExpires in a spooky eternity!\nNaturally Soulbound", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Jungle Juice", "Essentially paint thinner. Would be lethal\nto most mortals. Tastes aweful.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Gauntlet", "A mass of steel plating woven around a large\ndiamond to fit over one's hand. It seems\nrather simply made, however when the correct\nsequence of taps is applied to the gem (if\nprimed with mana) an enchantment would\nactivate. A sphere sized similarly to a\ngolfball will quickly come into being before\nthe gauntlet's leather palm. If the gauntlet\nis then thrusted forth, the ball will fire\nwith speeds just below that of an arrow in\nthe pushed direction.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Valmir__.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Handkerchief", "A hemmed square of thin fabric. perfect to\nwipe your nose with", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Owl", "A young owl that likes to sit upon once's\nshoulder. It watches you closely with it's\nbig eyes.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Poisoned Inferno", "This potion resembles the dark, glowing\nred hue on a burned log, yet to die out.\nPlacing it on the skin is ill advised, as it\ncreates a painful irritating feeling, slowly\nblistering and eroding your skin. A horrible\nstench that can scorch the hairs in\nyour nostrils is also produced in the process.\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Tax Slips (50)", "Tax slips fit for 50 mina each.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Blade", "", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Oak Wood", "A figurine carved by delicate and skilled\nhands. The figure is smeared with ink and\nseems to be wearing dark and dirty armor as\ndepicted by the creator. The bottom of the\nfigure has the head of a hound carved into it\nas a signature of some sort. It appears the\nsoldier/figurine is Northern.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mah'r Bluebrook.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Lumberjack's Recipe", "A famous potion among lumberjacks, this salve is\na great way to heal cuts and scrapes, but once\nit hits the bloodstream its nauseating.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
