        StaticItem("Half Heart Pendent", "A golden half heart on a silver chain. It\nseems to belong to a set. On the back, it\nsays: 'You are my other half. You have been\nfor many years. I love you.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [El'Haler] Nynaeve Aureon.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Sketchbook", "A pretty sketchbook with designs of vines,\nroots, leaves, and such on the leather\nbindings.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Covered Head] Nynaeve Sagehand.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("[H] Precious Painting", "This work of art is unlike anything you've ever seen.\n*Moderator Approved*\nfreema5 approved this item.", "minecraft:painting", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Knot Pendant", "A knot pendant made of Aurum. It is roughly\nin the shape of a heart. It would also be on\nan Aurum chain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nynaeve Sagehand.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Decorative Blue Egg", "This egg seemed to be colored blue with\npretty little designs with flowers.", "minecraft:egg", ""),
