        StaticItem("Sweet Baby Doll", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Figurine", "A small lapiz figurine of a Jay bird. It\nholds it's head up in a haughty manner and\nit's wings seem to square up at the shoulder\nin a way that gave it a more regal look. The\nlapiz was cut in such a way that the patterns\ncharacteristic to the Jay are seen.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jistuma.", "minecraft:lapis_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Forceful Crystal", "A crystal packed with\nfeathers.\nNote: These are not valid for roleplay.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Defensive Crystal", "A crystal packed with\nsturdy plantlife.\nNote: These are not valid for roleplay.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Blinding Crystal", "A crystal packed with\ndark liquid.\nNote: These are not valid for roleplay.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Thanhium Stud", "", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Unstrung Thornbark Stave", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Cow", "A soft small toy that is perfect for any\nchild. Filled with cotton, the realistic\nsmall cow held a rather cute smile.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Eternal Bloom Pendant", "A wide, flat bottle filled with clear oil and\nthe beautiful, lightly glowing, white bloom\nfrom a bryophite ascended. It's corked\ntightly and has a long, thin silver chain. In\nthe dark, it will continue glow.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Clayphish.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("T'a Halfling Pumpkin & Spice Smoke Pipe", "A Pumkin & Spice Pipe Tastes , It Would Smell\nGreat!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bahbou123456.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Toalak Extract", "A fine powder extracted from the mucous film\ncovering a toalak. Upon ingestion, one would\ndiscover its hallucinogenic properties.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Mask", "A fake pumpkin mask for the lovely Laethesia.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Unknown.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Drokon's Good Good", "An excellent kush of the Northern Desert\nvariety.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Totemic Club of Vulka", "This club clearly resembles that of an orcish\nspiritual totem. It stands at a firm 3 feet\nlong and would seem incredibly heavy for\nthose of smaller stature than an uruk.\nAttached, near the clubs head, sits a\ncollection of the tips of many tusks and\nantlers and below them the wooden wings of a\ntotem would signify a devotion to Vulka. The\nhandle of the club would be tightly wrapped\nin leather and the weapons cap would be\nforged of iron. https://tinyurl.com/yanq4oow\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Jandy_.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("A Large Bone", "The bone is clearly that of a large\nindividual. It appears to be a femur judging\nby the ball and socket joint at one end. The\nbone is completely devoid of flesh, and\nseveral fissures litter it. It has been\nbesmirched with dry blood.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aids_Of_Space.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Rough walking stick", "Not too lenghty, child-sized walking stick\nfor a limping elven boy!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dewlox.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Cactus Green", "In your hands, a prime piece of cactus green\nrests. With cactus farmed from the old\ndeserts by poorly paid goblins, where it was\nafterwards made into a paste and sold to you.\nThis cactus green is undoubtfully the best\none you can ever place yougins of the black\ncactus green do not have artificial origins,\nrather, the Gorkil clan used to breed the\ndarkest with the darkest of the cacti plants\nwith the belief that the darker the green is,\nthe stronger it is. And they were proven\nright.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Eath'Lur.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("[Trophy] Pit Champion, 1635", "This champion's sword is carved with a\nteutonic sigil that marked the first ever\nChampion Challenge. Special to the blade is\nalso carved in DEWLOX, KLOMP CHAMPION I,\n1635. -ET LatheBiosas\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LatheBiosas.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Blue Orchids", "A beautiful bouquet of neatly and carefully\ntied blue orchids. Both looks and smells\namazing. How wonderful!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dewlox.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Feather Duster", "A finely crafted tool used for dusting, it's\nwooden handle stained black and bound with\ntwo gold rings.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Maidservant.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("A Mini Totem Pole", "You hold a finely carved wooden totem in your\nhand. The faces of a wolf, bear, and hawk is\ncarved into the wood and painted with fine\ndetail.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Allieice.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolf Head Amulet", "Arcane I\nThe diligent work of an expert stonemason.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Ferrum Chestplate", "", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Sandworm Flesh", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("XXL Olog-Fitted Plate Helm", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("XXL Olog-Fitted Plate Boots", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("A Singular Large Plate from a Scaddernak", "An Impressively untouched plate from a large\nScaddernak. In the hands of a skilled\ncraftsman this piece could easily be turned\ninto all manner of remarkable tools, armor or\nweaponry and more.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:stone_pressure_plate", ""),
        StaticItem("Sabbat Bluesteel Blade", "A careful crafted blade, mended by goblin\nblacksmiths. The designs upon the hilt show a\nmiraculous design of scaddernak scales that\nmake up the shaft towards the arc of the\nblade like a Sabbat curve with razor teeth to\ndig and rip the flesh of those swung at.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:diamond_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Bejewled Chestplate", "This chestplate is enchanted with a powerful\nward against Lightning Evocation magic (Up to\nT5). The enchantment is strong enough for one\nuse, once the ward burns away a single spell\nin defence its rendered useless until its\nnext recharged. If defending from multiple\nsmall spells of lightning like sparks it can\nlast up to five uses but cannot defend from a\nfull bolt if one was casted at the wearer\nafter defending from said small spells until\nrecharged. If confused PM the Signee of this\nitem\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toxzero.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Bejewled Greaves", "These ferrum leg plates were skillfully\nenchanted to summon a torrent of air that\nslowly begins to incase the wearer. It takes\ntwo emotes to charge up before the air is\npowerful enough to deflect projectiles and\npush anything in a 1 block radius back with a\nstaggering force, though one can easily swing\na sword through it or cast magic through it.\nThis has one use before needing to be charged\nand lasts up to six emotes in combat. A\nphrase must be uttered for use. (PM\nBestscarface76 to interact)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toxzero.", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Mail", "Armour designed to fit goblins.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Stoneman Dust", "This is a cow leather pouch containing\nStoneman dust. It has been processed from the\nthumb of a Stoneman. It is sufficient for\nproduction of explosives.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:gunpowder", ""),
        StaticItem("Hellscream", "The large head of the seven foot long,\nvibrant brownish-metal axe was adorned in\nmultiple extravagant runic carvings. Near the\nback of the top bit of the axe rested the\nskull of a dragon -- In both of it's eyes a\npair of glistening rubies. When the words\nwere said, electricity would surge about the\naxe, capable of causing some mild burning and\nparalyzation. One emote to activate, two to\ncharge. [[ Contact PurpleCola for more info\n]]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Rolien’s Conductor Scythe", "An elegant but highly detailed Scythe created\nby a Smith of great skills would be resting\nin your gaze. The scythe’s made from black\nfurrum allowing it to be strong and reliable,\nthe blade of this scythe ranging to be around\noh most a broadswords length with a curve to\nit toward the base of the pole. The pole\nsimple being around 5”o long and around 1/2\nfoot wide. The Pole made of dark oak that'd\nbe highly polished to a gleam. (pm Dark_elf01\nfor more info)\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Trapdoor", "A very large piece of a door which weighs\napproximately eighty pounds, made from wood\nand iron studs.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Azdromoth.", "minecraft:trapdoor", ""),
        StaticItem("Vampyrean", "Arcane I\nA jagged-bladed shortsword that seems best\nfor the use of a stake instead of during\nswordplay. This weapon was used in a battle\nagainst a Striga in the depths of\nTor'Azdraeth, by the old Orc Thra'marath.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Idolomun.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Karate (or Kung Fu) Egg ★", "Some rumour that the hou-zi once got into\nmartial arts and began to break bricks with\ntheir bare hands. There was a point that they\ncould break even a thousand bricks at once,\nbut then, a suspicious easter orc came and\ngave them some easter eggs that couldn't be\nbroken even by the strongest of the hou-zi.\nNow, one of these very eggs rests on your\nhand, but it was softened with the power of\nlove. Also, it tastes of chocolate and peanut\nbutter. Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Eepz' War Club", "A large stone war club once owned by the Ogre\nEepz. It looks strong enough to bash through\nmost walls.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:stone_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Ogre's Foot", "A swollen foot cut from a mighty Deeproad's\nOgre.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:rabbit_foot", ""),
        StaticItem("The Damage Fang of a Large Scaddernak", "A fang broken at one end, it looks to have\nbeen torn from the mouth of a sizeable\nScaddernak, this piece could easily be made\ninto an impressive trophy for the holder to\nshow off his accomplisment to all.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Fiut'Fivhhundred", "Arcane I\nA great hammer of large proportion, forged\nfrom the mightiest steel known to the\nworld... Blood Steel. It's surface adorned\nlong, vein-like rivers of a bone-white\ncolour. It's handle consisted of a largebone\nof a most exotic creature, wrapped in tough\nleather. It appeared that the axe head had\nmany strange writings etched into it's\nsurface.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Chinese New Year Bow", "A bow for the Chinese New Year Dunk Tank!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Chinese New Year Dragon Dust", "Dust from the serpent that guarded the year\nof the rooster festival!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AnotherDay.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Bejewled Boots", "Arcane I\nSteel boots bearing gems a little above each\nheel. When a certain activation phrase is\nstated, spikes of two inch log quartz will\nbegin to appear before each foot - launching\nout when the wearer kicks foward! One emote\nto charge, one to produce the spikes, and one\nto use.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("The Infernal Staff", "A large staff composed heavily of Arcaurum belonging\nto Archmage Crumena of the Mages' Guild. Numerous\nArcane related accessories hang from the staff's head\nas it radiates a glow akin to that of burning embers. The\nstaff itself is enchanted to augment and improve the\nefficiency of all fire affinity spells as the head of the\nstaff engrosses the incapacitating heat of the Dwarven\nDeep Roads tucked away hidden below Kal’Azgoth\nwhilst numerous glyphes shine faintly down the staff's\nshaft.\n*Moderator Approved*\nman5791 approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Hammer of Domination", "The hilt of the hammer is quite simple, with\njust a rough fabric being wrapped around the\ndark wood. The actual hammerhead itself is of\nincredible quality, with the steel shining\nbrightly in the sun. Two bands of leather\nhave been wrapped round each hand, with studs\nin place to give it a more savage look. On\neach striking end of the hammer, you notice\nsmall, intricate carvings of what you could\nonly guess to be ancient writings, with each\none being finely carved into the surface.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Gauntlet", "A black ferrum gauntlet with runic etchings\nthat curled about the steel in an extravagent\nmanner. If one were to speak the runes or had\nbinded it to them with their blood, the runes\nwould activate and electricity would begin to\nform around the open space above the\ngauntlet. After that, the electricity would\nform into a ball. The electric bolt that\nwould fire from the ball is capable of\nparalysis and other bad effects.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashbringer", "A long sword fourty two inches in lenght of\naengul steel make, the handle bound by\nleather. The steel of the sword was decorated\nin multiple intricate carvings -- The work of\na runesmith. If the owner of the sword were\nto speak the activating phrase, fire would\nslowly wreathe the blade. It takes one emote\nto activate, and two more to fully charge up.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Hide Strap", "This leather strap resembles boiled leather,\nyet is slightly stronger than it. Upon\ninspection, you would begin to realise it was\ncrafted from a wyvern’s hide, although it was\ndyed since. It’s fire resistant and an\neffective leather armor that straps to belts.\nIt has tiny compartments for potions.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RammerJammer73.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Forgiveness Cookie", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Circus of Misfortune Invitation", "This piece of paper keeps yelling and screaming in a high pitched voice.\nIt also has a large M written on it. This might be the most annoying piece of paper\never, but it's also fascinating because of the smell of starberries.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Future Egg ★", "An easter egg made of white chocolate even if\nthe technology of now doesn't allows such.\nProbably a fat rabbit travelled in time and\nwarped it through the fabric of space, but\nthis doesn't even changes the taste. Happy\neaster!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Tobacco Roll", "Used to calm down the smoker, making them\nfeel less stressed. Mainly used by soldiers,\nor those suffering through hard times.\nHowever, many use it for personal reasons.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Golem Finger", "A severed finger from a long forgotten golem\nconstruct, the finger feeling somewhat\nlifelike even with its stony texture. Wavy\nwater designs roll all around the finger up\nuntil you reach the rocky chipped area.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ymbninjakiller.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Scaddernak Exoskeleton", "*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Bones of Chutagla", "The dull bones tell it's history, the marks\non them the proof of the battle between the\nnortherners and the dragon Chutagla.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by PorkNchopS.", "minecraft:bone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruhn oz Varekan", "The metal sphere is rather cool to the touch\nbut warms upon activation. The curving shapes\nof the runes across the surface light up at\nthe touch of the user and emit a bright\nwhite-blue light from across the entire\nsurface of the sphere. As it is with all\nrunes, the runes would cease to work without\na timely renewal and would stop working all\ntogether after several uses.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:sea_lantern", ""),
        StaticItem("Boggen Claw", "A long, dagger-like claw, would be of about 6\ninches in length. The claw would appear to be\nin perfect condition.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Token", "A Chalice is imprinted on the golden coin.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by InfamousCanadian.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Cyclops's Head", "A large Cyclops head with one eye, one tusk\nmissing, and an ear missing.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _SurrenderMaine_.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Fur Pelt", "The pelt of this once living animal, was\nskinned from a beast large enough to cover an\nuruk from head to toe in fur. The fur would\nbe soft from ware yet slightly water proof\nfrom the animals natural oils.(If crafted\ninto something msg dtrik)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dead Animal Pelt.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Pelt of a Demigryph", "A paled golden pelt of a demigryph. It was\ncovered in very short, sleek dark-gold hair.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Super Sonic Sour Sweets!", "These have quite a kick to them!\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:fire_charge", ""),
        StaticItem("Harolds' Pity Bread", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Haroldoni.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Golem Core", "A '6 by '6 cube of a translucent, gold hued\nsubstance with what appeared to be a shard of\nthanium within it. Etched onto five out of\nits six, near perfectly flat sides, a strange\ncarving would be scribed. Should this object\ncome into the correct hands, it could be put\nto great use.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Idolomun.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Bar", "This thick gold bar would have the etchings\nof a Griffon \"Glory apon god which is my\nmaker.\" would be engraved into the gold\ningot, it will too display the smiths\nSignature - M.A\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Dannybrine.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Crude Bonespear", "A crudely fashioned spear with a bone tip.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bokermon.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of Luara Blue Fire", "This staff is enchanted to release a torrent\nof red hot flames that go the distance of 3\nblocks. It will take two emotes to charge up\nand one emote to cast. The staff will need to\nbe refilled after three uses. The magic\nenchanted is no more powerful than fire\nevocation. At the top of the staff is a ruby\nholding the mana for the enchantment\nelegantly fitted to the staff.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toxzero.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Cosmic Egg ★", "An easter egg that was launched into space\nfrom another planet with a catapult, and,\nduring its course, it crossed a\nspace-rainbow, acquiring all of its tastes.\nYou can't define the flavour, but it tastes a\nbit like... sugar. Did it even come from\nsomewhere else? Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Momozkahin' Poizun", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by freema5.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern's Scales", "A tough hide taken from a bull wyvern\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RammerJammer73.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of holding", "Arcane I\nThis ornate staff allows you to cause two\nobjects within 3 feet of the stave of up to\nfive pounds (2.2 KG) to float towards the\nstaff head once the head of the staff is\ntapped. The heads follow the staff, and\nceases to float once the head is tapped\nagain.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("➳ Emberthorn Arrow [T5] ➳", "A quiver of arrows tipped with smoldering\nwhite embers. While useless against armor,\nthe embers tear through corrupted flesh like\na hot knife through butter and, if not\nquickly removed, might set the wound alight\nwith holy white flame. After making contact\nwith a corrupted being or, if your aim is\nbad, a wall, the arrow’s infusion dies;\nleaving only a feathered stick.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("A red collection of hairs", "This collection of hairs once belonged to the\nnow-deceased Lindrael Torena, and was cut\nfrom the rest of his hair by a golden knife.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Seashell of Cernunnos", "A seashell used by numerous crabs for their\nhomes, or to protect from the wilds. Now,\nabandoned and left to the will of nature.\nThis unique, mystical item can be held to\none's ear as they would hear the marches of\nthe wilds.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Bracelet", "Interlocking loops of golden material,\nmanifesting a lovely bracelet for ones wrist!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DrPhilOfLOTC.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Vin Auvergnat", "A fine Auvergnian red of recent vintage.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ski_king3.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Short Sword", "A short sword taken from a slain Deeproad's\nGoblin.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dreeks' Rolex", "You would see that the watch is encrusted\nwith diamonds, emeralds and the movement is\nmade of a clear looking lump of quartz. This\nis surely, the watch of the Grand King.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elven Bones", "This is a scattering of ancient elven bones,\nforming an incomplete skeleton. They are\nmottled and scratched, some have been worn\ndown to nothing. They are tinged green and\nwhite from moisture and sun exposure.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("-+- Niccum Bodee's Supreme Barbeque Ribs -+-", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sir_Niccum.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Remains of the Dark Staff", "The huge, decorated bone would appear to be\nhalf of a staff. Ceremonial feathers hung\nfrom the remaining end. You felt uneasy at\nevery glance however, almost as if something\nwere calling for you.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Tubby Olog's Head", "It would appear to be the head of an obese\nOlog. It still reeks with a putrid scent.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Everyleaf", "This is a leaf of undefined species. It is a\nbrilliant green-red, and smells like fresh\nrainfall. It is the size of your palm, no\nmatter who holds it. It will never turn brown\nor wilt, and from its stem leaks a milky sap\nthat tastes like raspberries.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:leaves", ""),
        StaticItem("Golem Chin", "Looks to be a rocky chin with intricate wavy\nwater patterns, once belonging to an ancient\ngolem.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ymbninjakiller.", "minecraft:sandstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider Silk", "This silk seems to have been taken care of\nrather well. It may hold some sentimental\nvalue.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:snow", ""),
        StaticItem("Sutican Kush", "Kin to the Sutica Kush plant and the Mango\nstrain, Sutica Kush is a pure indica with\nsome seriously tasty flavors.Aside from the\nfantastic taste of this tropical-infused\nstrain, you would experience a happy high and\na good nights sleep.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Opiate Powder", "A highly pure, strong opiate ground from the\npoppy fields of southern Asul. This powder\nwould mostly be used to resolve pain, but can\nbe easily abused if taken in higher dosages.\nThe powder would contain a light greyish\ncolour, almost white, showing its purity.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elven Dagger", "This is an exceptionally crafted obsidian\ndagger. It is encrusted with pinfire opal,\nencircled with bands of elk bone and deer\nleather, and studded with copper. It menaces\nwith spikes of orichalcum. Its hilt is\nwrapped in tortoise leather. It smells\nfaintly of cinnamon.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Locket", "A well made locket melted of a mixture of\ngold and silver. It is a link of many little\nchain-rings which form up to the locket\nitself. If opened, it has one empty side for\na picture to be put, and the other side\npadded with soft red cotton.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Brokenhelix.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial Of Thick Cockatrice Blood", "The glass vial was filled with a dark red\nliquid, that appeared similar to normal\ndescendant blood, despite it originating from\na Cockatrice.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpodoKaiba.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Ring", "Upon a golden band lies embedded a diamond\ngem, sparkling with minor illumination. An\nexpensive piece, and a beautiful one.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Daniel Ward.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("-+- Niccum Bodee's Supreme Rack o' Ribs -+-", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sir_Niccum.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Melted Gold Lance", "A disfigured item from a former comrade. The\nlance would be melted by some sort of flame,\nand twisted with rotted flesh. A trophy for\nthose who slain the Vodnik who wielded this.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by BedsAreBurning.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("The Smaller Plate of a Scaddernak", "A small plate in good condition, looking to\nhave been pried from a Scaddernak without any\nresistance, a remarkable piece to be sure. It\nholds much potential for the hands of skilled\ncraftsman.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Decayed Hand", "What appears to be a hand of bone with\ndecaying flesh, stained with a purple hue. It\nseems to carry a heavy scent of death with\nit. How horrid!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Corrupted Olog's Hide", "The skinned hide of a corrupted Olog, flayed\nfrom it at the time of its death.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DoYouRemember.", "minecraft:stained_hardened_clay", ""),
        StaticItem("Bejewled Sword", "A lightweight sword made from meteorite. The\nblade is a pure shade of black, long and\nsharp. Within the crossguard rests a sizeable\ngem, shimmering occasionally with energy.\nThose who know how it works will find the\nsword capable of coating itself in fire for a\ndecent amount of time. One emote for the\ncharge, one for the actual activation.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SpiffyTaylor.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Azure Simorgh feathers", "A radiant, azure feather that glistens\nwonderfully when exposed to light at certain\nangles. It's quite long too, being at least\nan entire foot long. Would make for a great\nquill, or hat and hair accessory.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Reindeer Skull", "What can I say? Father Krugmas\ngets hungry too.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Talon of a Winged Screamer", "This massive bird talon is as hard as steel\nand as black as tar.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murdervish.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Spider Hide", "A hide retrieved from a Large Spider that\ninvaded San'Raakh.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Lead", "Raelplayer's lasso.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Raelplayer.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Shroudborne Blade", "Arcane I\nA ferrum blade tarnished with necromantic\ncorruption, a darkened shadow seeming to\nshift constantly on its surface. The fine\nedge will draw lifeforce alongside blood, and\nwith each feeding the shadow seems to darken\nand spread.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("ORDER OF BRAVERY", "For those who show themselves to be truly\nselfless and willing to charge headlong into\nthe fires, there is the Order of Bravery.\nOften heroic Knights and courageous soldiers\nwho have shown little regard for their safety\nwhen the Empire is on the line.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zhulik.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Coin of Strength", "A coin gifted by a traveler of whom visited\nCanahedo and requested they protect an item\nfrom the undead hordes. A token of grattitude\nfor obtaining victory. A token gifted to a\nwarrior who proved their strength.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shambleau.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Cloth", "A lovely piece of crimson, glistening in the\nsunlight by its given material\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DrPhilOfLOTC.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Troll club", "A troll's wooden club, covered in throns.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SaintPaint.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Olog Skull", "a skull of a giant olog, with a crack down\nthe middle of it. To some, it may remind them\nof a strange camp.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Jasper the Cat.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem(". . . .", "Special Ability: Bone Break\n20% chance on full hit to cripple target.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Gajutar (Armored Morko Bear)", "", "minecraft:name_tag", ""),
        StaticItem("Windswept Staff", "An excellent but\nunremarkable walking stick.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Tome of the Lumberjack", "Brimming with raw knowledge.", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of jarofdirt", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of BigMacMoMo", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Ozmandu", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Leorabbit99", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of mrpepsiwaffles", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of young_rogue", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of deliciouss", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Original_Potato", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Brazilianski", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of EdgyKitchenSink", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of TriscuitFistIt", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Darkfox4", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of TheCrazySoviet", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sapphire Ring", "A beautifully designed gold engagement ring.\nThe band has multiple vines engraved along\nthe outer edge with small sapphire along it.\nInside is engraved \"Even a Wolf needs a pack\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JadePetal.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose", "A red rose often given out as gifts to women\nby members of House Ebonheart as sign of\nrespect.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dewlox.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Glowing Glob of Wax", "A rather large glob of tannish-yellow wax,\nthat seems to glow dully. Aside from it's\nglowing, it has no deviant properties from\nstandard wax. whether for use in a candle,\nseal, or as a glue.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("Thanhium-studded Tunic", "+16% Magic Resistance\n+10% Archery Damage", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Family Ring", "A band of pure aurum that obtains only the\nmost alluring appearance. At the centre is a\nharpy made of tungsten carbide, crafted\ncarefully with plenty of detail for it is\nheld on by prongs of wire made from the same\nmaterial as the shank. Moonstone and\nmorganite make up the limbs of the being;\nreplacement for the feathery limbs. Hidden in\nsight upon the gallery is the the simple\nsurname ^Tahn'thill^, for all those whom\npossess such a beautiful piece belongs to the\nbloodline.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahn'thill Family.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Freedom", "Freedom is a fine longsword. It's hilt is\nmade of birch and has a small ruby on it.\nThe blade itself has a straight point,\nand shines a bright orange akin to fire.\nIt's currently held by the Novokain\nfamily; one of the three swords reforged\nfrom Red Sun.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Potatoe Sack", "Can be used to store potatoes, and can be\nused for other kinds of events...", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Golden Clockwork", "The golden clockwork seems ancient and\nmagical. It's purpose however remains a\nmystery.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Sea Pearl", "A pretty little sea pearl that gleams\nbeautifully when it reflects moonlight!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Anadunae.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Piece of Blubber", "The blubber is very slippery to touch, and\nwill probably rot after a few days.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Legion Donation Pendant", "The Shiny Gold Pendant shows the Insignia of\nthe 1st Legion, and an inscription below it\nsays: \"With this Pendant, You, A Valued\nCitizen of Oren, Show your support and\nwillingness to aid in the growth of the\nLegion. May this show all that you have done\nyour part in helping the Legion, its\nLegionnaires, and most importantly, The Holy\nOrenian Empire! Ave Orenia!!!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fnik.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Cernunnos Statue", "The quartz has been carefully chiseled into\nthe form of an imposing male with\nproud antlers, a bow in his hands strung\nwith a strand of silken thread.\nThe squared base he stands upon reads,\nCernunnos the Great Huntsman.", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Candle of Light", "Given to those who arrived to Aethermoore’s\nvery first festival, this candle is a small\nlittle thing. The candle’s holder is of twisted gold,\nholding a beeswax candle within it.\nIts wick is unlit.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Bad to the Bone", "A six foot bone originating from an unknown\ncreature. Whose idea was it to carry this\naround? It can probably smack someone real\ngood, but other than that it just sits there.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantUsopp.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Never-ending flask [Wine]", "A seemingly empty flask, but when you take a\nsip, wine comes out of it. It appears it\ndoesn’t have an end, where does it come from?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Gus's Flower", "A flower picked specifically for Gus. It was\nred to match his jacket. It was a pretty\nflower, just like Gus. Yes, for Gus is a\npretty flower.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SnugglyKittens.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("DRUID MAGICS", "Zwoom! Zap! Pow pow! Kachooomfp!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Ydan Lohraw's Low-Class Urn", "A clay pot crafted with below-average quality\nclay. The archaic urn has served the test of\ntime as the urn has very little cracks\nrunning along its frame.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by the Regionally Known Artist,\n- Ydan Lohraw", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Robes of the Fallen Priest", "A beautiful robe made of cirmson red fabric w\nith golden ruines embroidered in it. Blood\nstains are apparent on the inside of the\nrobe, however. ((Obtained in the Far Glade))\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by the Human,\n- Dead Priest", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Summoning Misfortune", "A book with unwritten pages. On the front is a large cycle with a big eye in the\nCenter. Underneath this Symbol is written 'Close your Hands, Close the eyes, Misfortune\nhere it Comes.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Requiem", "A fine Bluesteel longsword, forged in the\nheart of Urguan. The grip is made from a\nsolid oak, with the word 'Requiem' engraved\ninto the side. The pommel of the blade\ncontains a flawless emerald in the center,\nwhich glistens ever so slightly in the\nsunlight.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bert Palington.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Moonlight", "This dagger is beautifully decorated. It's\npommel is a small golden sun, with golden\nrays going all over the black ferrum hilt,\nslowly fading. The crossguard is set with\nsmall diamonds, representing stars, while a\nbigger one in the middle of the crossguard\nrepresents the moon. The blade itself is made\nfrom sharpened silver, shining marvelously,\nand has Celia engraved in it, along with an\noak tree, closer to the hilt.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skywhale Plushie", "A large plushie around the size of a pillow.\nIt is akin to that of a sky whale, the\nlargest animal to have ever graced the sky.\nIt is deep blue, like that of a sky whale\nflying over the oceans.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dirk Martijn I Novokain.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Boomsteel Ore", "An extremely heavy ore notable by its\nebony-like hue. Distinguishable from other\nsimilarly-coloured veins by the acrid,\nmetallic and sour smell in raw form. In this\nstate, it’s extremely unstable. An added\namount of pressure, heat or friction is\nlikely to cause the ore to combust and burst\ninto shards.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Oyashima Chimes", "While perhaps not worth anything in the Isles\nof Axios, they make quite a souvenir for\nthose interested in Aeldinic lands.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Mystical Silver Pocket Watch", "The hands of this device appear to\ncontinuously click with perfect accuracy.\nSmall enough to fit in one's pocket, it's the\nideal tool for time-telling. However, to\nthose that are particularly astute, small\nglimmers of light flitter around its face, as\nthough unseen forces are at work. [PM Gladuos\nfor details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Daniel 'Vince' Ward.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Red-Veined Dagger", "A dagger made of yellow metal threaded with\nred, rusting veins. it poses no advantage\nother than giving the stabbed tetanus.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Zhulik.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Booboo keys...", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FKb_np_khY0", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Impermeable Jewelry Box", "A silver box encrusted with variously-sized\nfine gems; precious and semi-precious stones\nsuch as topaz, sapphires, rubies, and others\nwork together in perfect unison to give the\ncontainer an aesthetically pleasing design.\nThere is no visible keyhole on the lock and\nit remains latched shut no matter how hard\none tries to pry it open with their bare\nhands. [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Daniel 'Vince' Ward.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Fleur du Cantal - Vintage 1576", "A powerful aromatic red wine born from grapes\nof the Barony of Cantal. It's an Auvergnian\nstyle wine fermented in the traditional manor\nof the House Valois; world famous in Oren\nthroughout the ages. It sponsors full-bodied\nwine with a faintly earthy taste. It sports\nvintage of the year, 1576.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by french_king3.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Toast", "Hot bread and butter.\nFood: 5\nSaturation: 4.0\nExpires in 2d 12h 1m", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("The Misfortune Bow", "This bow sounds funny... It\nalso shoots backwards!\nBe careful!\n*Moderator Approved*\nGigarun approved this item.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Token of the Herald", "These white shards of frost leave\na cold aura around them, faint cracks\necho from them now and again.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Leaf Ape Ashes", "The ashes of a Valahii'Ame, or Leaf Ape.\nThese would miraculously remain impervious to\nbeing disturbed by anything of ferrum origin,\nand would reek of burnt hair and flesh.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Petrified Egg", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ever.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Meat", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Wyvern.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Purple Raven Feather", "An overly large purple feather plucked from a\nraven", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Halfling Shekels", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Ship Carving", "A beechwood carving of a schooner, with thin\nlinen sails.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Obsidian Forest", "A tome of unknown origins possessing\nqualities both voidal and strange. The book’s\ncover is as puzzling as it’s content; It is\nwrought not of leather but of some sort of\ndark stone material, hard to the touch. It\nhas been engraved on it’s front with a forest\nof pine, and upon it’s back the same forest,\na single tower within atop a hill. [For full\ndescription PM Tehlulu or use the following\nlink: http://tinyurl.com/ameonn3]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcanic Shield", "A jet black metallic bracer with leather\npadding for comfortable wearing. On its\nsurface is embedded a singular azure crystal,\nglimmering faintly. PM Gladuos for details.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Single-edged Rondel Dagger", "The slim, sharp blade emits a dull, red glow.\nIt's fainter than a candle's light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by UnBaed.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Transdimensional Mirror", "Arcane I\nA grand ovular mirror shining with brilliance\ndue to its precious silver nature. It's\nencrusted with numerous fine diamonds all\nalong its borders, allowing the item to\nproduce a luminous effect. An aura of mystery\nsurrounds this object, but its reflection\nseems normal enough. [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("The Arcanic Whispering", "Arcane I\nA massive torso-sized leatherbound tome which\nbears no title on its face, though on its\nfirst page the words 'Arcanic Whispering' are\nnoticed. Flipping through the grimoire one\nwould come to find it encompasses a large\namount of information regarding Arcanism. The\nbook is covered in many aurum bindings while\nruby gemstones encrust its entire spine, both\ngiving off a faint orange-tinted aura and\nsheening with potential energy. [Not enough\ninformation to self-teach] [PM Gladuos for\ndetails]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Mask of Death", "A decaying pumpkin that is used as a mask, it\nsmells disgusting and putrid, however the\nwearer of the mask is able to see how long\nplantation, and animals, have left to live by\nsimply staring into their eyes.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Spikey Seedcase", "A spikey bundle of extra thin and sharp black\nneedles which act as a protective shield for\nthe pod of seeds contained within.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("⊙ Gilded Visage ⊙", "Ornate and etched with innumerable carvings,\nyou see a golden emotionless mask with red\ngemstones for eyes. A sheen of potential\nwashes over its surface as it has no purpose\nwhile being worn. Given the know-how an\nenchanter could tap into this object for the\nuse of illusion-based enchantments. [PM\nGladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Stalwart Statuette", "Arcane I\nA white stone statuette depicting an elderly\nman hunched and carrying a massive boulder on\nhis back. It gives off a minor sheen over its\nsurface as to hint at its magical presence.\nThis can be tapped into for the purpose of\nbeing an earth evocation entrapment. [PM\nGladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Starry Beach Blanket", "A rectangular quilted blanket covered in a\npattern of stars and the curling waves of an\nocean beneath. A simple piece that still\nsomehow reveals a calmed setting of a\nnight-time front. It's rather comfortable as\nwell.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Perseverant Cloak", "A furry cape at the length which would\nadequately fit a human or elf-sized\nindividual. On both sides near the clavicles\nare two metal clasps used to wear the cloak.\nDecorative elongated ruby gemstones are sat\nupon these clasps, glowing occasionally with\norange to red lights, barely noticable to the\nmortal eye. One would find that the cloth is\nrather resistant against being damaged,\nfrozen, or burned. [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Daniel 'Vince' Ward.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Anchored Canebrella", "A beautiful iron cane which has engraved\norchids twirling around its entirety. There\nare two azure gems on opposing sides near the\ntip of the cane and parallel to them at the\nbottom are respective metallic switches.\nActivating one switch will cause the cane to\nsprout an umbrella canopy with iron\nstretchers. Flipping the other switch\nlabelled 'anchor', the canebrella will anchor\nitself in space, floating several feet above\nthe ground. [PM Gladuos to interact]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Daniel 'Vince' Ward.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("The Everlasting Azure", "One would see a relatively mundane clay pot,\nfilled to the brim with rich soil. However,\nshould the holder investigate further, or\nshould they be capable of sensing faint\nmagical auras, the item is revealed to be\nmore than what it seems. DO NOT PLACE DOWN.\nPM Gladuos for details.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Regenerative Skin Balm", "A whimsical vial filled to the brim with a\ndull brown concoction. With contact to the\nsubstance, the user would have a cool calming\nsensation, followed by the moisturization,\nrejuvenation, and smoothening of the skin.", "minecraft:potion", "")
    )

    private fun _AXIOS_CERU_8(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Diamond Jewled Brooch", "A brooch made of silver shaped to look like a\nwolf's head facing forward. Its jaw hangs\nlow, baring its teeth clutching a gloriously\ncarved diamond of a cool color. Fury burns in\nthe wolf's eyes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by UnBaed.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Wolf Brooch", "An elegantly carved emerald gem shaped to\nlook like a wolf looking forward.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nemir.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Banded Ring", "A silver banded ring with specially made\ngrooves to fit a warmly color topaz. It\nshines beautifully in the light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by UnBaed.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Tranquil Chances", "Inside a simple glass wine bottle is held a\nsweetly herbal, spiced brew created with\nexpert care. The wine is aged and fermented\nto near perfection, almost magically so. It\ngives a warmth to those that drink it, yet\nnot in any way that suggests something\nabnormal. Authentic and true, the wine\nremains corked and ready to be enjoyed. Near\nthe front one would see a small label,\ndisplaying its title in elegant font,\nTranquil Chances'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Flame Orb", "Arcane I\nA precious aurum sphere sized to fit in one's\npalm. On its surface would be a fixed ruby\ngemstone, inside which are infrequent\nglimmers of magic. A switch is forged on the\nopposite side, ready to be activated.\nFurthermore, a steel framework reinforces the\naurum, bracing it against some potential\nimpact. [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Crimson Arcane Blade", "In your hand is a magic dagger as sharp and\nstrong as its mundane steel counterparts. The\nhilt is an enchanted one made from arcaurum\nreinforced by lightweight steel, especially\naround the small crossguard. In its pommel\nlies a sparkling diamond gemstone, imbued\nwith voidal power. The blade is made of a\nglowing red arcane evocation, lodged securely\nby its magical nature and an inherent socket.\n[PM Gladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Imbibed Fountain Statuette", "A statuette small enough to be held in the\npalm of one's hand. Its weight is still\nconsiderable however as it is seemingly\ncomposed entirely of granite. Small glimmers\nof red and orange magic sometimes pass over\nthe surface, barely visible to the naked eye.\nFor any wizard capable of such, this may be\nutilized for the sake of a water entrapment\nin the creation of enchantments. [PM Gladuos\nfor details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ward's Wondrous Wizardry.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Strawberry Snowcone", "Cleanly shaven ice, flavored with fresh,\nsweet strawberries picked from the fields in\nDevirad.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Thot Patrol Badge", "This green and white hand stitched patch.\nComes with black letters along the center\nThot Patrol", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Toodles is a lil'bitch", "Its in the name.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Good Samaritan Badge of Honor", "A reward given to the greatest of men; the bug reporters,\nthe helpers and the.. brilliant. Yes, truly a grand reward.\n*Moderator Approved*\nPandann approved this item.", "minecraft:light_weighted_pressure_plate", ""),
        StaticItem("Gladuos is bad and should feel bad.", "Food: 4\nSaturation: 3.0\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Bean Buns", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cruzazul8.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Head token", "Allows you to buy one singular creative\nplayerhead!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HBrules.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Rondel Dagger", "The dagger's blade gives off a faint red\nglow.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Runed Circlet", "A beautifully forged circlet, aureate in\nnature and engraved with illustrious\ncarvings, this circlet holds several engraved\nand etched Dwed runes into the surface of the\nmetal, the edges of the engravings smoothened\nout to add a nice finish.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena Izalith.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Circlet of Solace", "An ornamental band made from precious silver,\nforged to seem as many twisting strings\nbraided together. The front of the tiara\nexpands to allow space for the socketed blue\ngemstones, which glimmer beautifully.\nWhomever wears this headpiece may find\nhimself or herself at ease; a feeling of\npeace, comfort, and relief gradually washing\nover them as their mind is sanctified and\nprotected. [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Aethermoor Amulet", "This amulet takes on a shape similar to the\nsun, the center of it holding a red ruby.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SpodanoArentonio.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bundle of Orchids", "Clusters of blue flowers wrapped together by\npaper, a golden ribbon holding it tightly. To\nthose it may, the symbolism conveys the\nreceiver love, strength, and peace of heart.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Daniel 'Vince' Ward.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Flower of Affection", "Arcane I\nA crimson rose that when held will grant the\nperson a longing warmth within their heart,\nor simply strengthen the bonds they already\nshare. A truly romantic gift, or even\nsomething to give a family member. The\nfeelings, while lessened, will stay even\nafter the flower is no longer there.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Disruptors", "A shard of arcanium suspended midair in a\ncylindrical reinforced glass case. On one of\nthe ends of the glass case is a small button\nthat when pressed will crush the arcanium in\non itself, breaking it into many pieces and\nreleasing the mana stored within the arcanium\ninto the glass case.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Fire Runestone", "A well rounded stone, normal in all ways; All\nbut the flattened surface on one side.\nEngraved onto said surface would be a\nparticular rune, and when the Ancient Dwedmar\nword for 'fire' is spoken, the rune would\nbegin to light up, and fire would spout and\nspur from it's carvings. The fire would take\na few seconds to pour out, though once the\nfire is unleashed it will burn like any other\nfire.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Coltaine's Rib Bone", "The rib bone of a very spooky lich.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by IDontCare_Bear.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Enigmatic Slab", "A black slab of metallic origin formed into a\nrectangular shape, small enough to fit in\none's hand. Grooves and etchings are engraved\nalong the artifact. On it is a beautiful\nazure crystal, glimmering in the light. PM\nGladuos for details.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Ebony Arcane Orb", "Arcane I\nAn opaque black sphere made from a dense\nmetal. Based on its appearance alone one\nmight surmise it is at least externally black\nsteel. On one side is a pure white crystal,\ncut and fixed into the metalwork. The other\nside one might find a switch unflipped. Once\nactivated via the switch, the orb will only\nhave a few moments to charge before evoking\nflame in all directions for a mild radius.\nQuite the dangerous item! [PM Gladuos for\ndetails]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Short Note", "Ael, my love, the greatest thing that has\never happened to me. I lay here now with this\nlittle boy in my arms and I weep. I weep not\nfor me, but for the fact I will not be here\nto help give him the love he needs. Take care\nof him, Aelthir. Love him as I have loved\nyou. Tell him of our love, tell him of how\nthe world seemed to still when I looked into\nyour eyes, and how my heart would burst when\nyou would smile. I love you, Aelthir. And I\nwill be with you, around you, until you can\nmeet me once more. I know The mother will\nallow me to bring you to the Plain of The\nAspects with me.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ara.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("The Sparrow Staff", "Arcane X\nDelicately carved by hand, the oaken staff in\nhand would resonate with a natural pulse felt\nwithin the palms of any attuned druid. Along\nthe stave, carved and living vines alike\nsnake upwards, creating a delicate pattern,\nweaving in and around the uppermost part.\nBrightly coloured flowers grace the staff and\nhighlight the warm brown of the rod. Perched\non top, a beautifully carved sparrow with\nspread wings creates the finishing touches\nneeded to complete the intricate staff.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Arahaelth, The Sparrow Druid.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Dreamcatcher", "An intricate and handwoven dreamcatcher - a\nsimple means of decor. The thin ring of a\nwillow branch would neither be twister nor\nbroken, almost grown in the manner that it\nresided. Interwoven and artistically crafted,\nthe threads of finely spun cotton lace\ntogether, replicating the natural pattern of\na spider’s web. Dangling from the lower rim\nof the piece, three feathers hang in\nsuccession, that of a bluejay, sparrow, and\nmockingjay. Various colorful clay beads\nlitter the weaving found within the circle,\nillustrating a very similar pattern to that\nof a snowflake.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Arahaelth.", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("Snow Elf Screamer", "REEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("CABLAM!", "Get CABLAMED kid.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:tnt", ""),
        StaticItem("Old great-rapier", "A rather strange, well crafted steel blade,\nthe handle and and crossguard of the weapon\nwould be akin of a normal weapon, all in old\ndarkened iron, yet the steel blade would be\nas thin, deadly, and sharp as a rapier's\nblade.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jentos.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Elegant Daisy Crown", "Incredibly, this circlet of flora appears to\nhave been grown into the shape it now\nmaintained. With thickened stalks intertwined\nand blossoming with pleasant smelling\nflowers, the crown would never grow weary nor\nwould the flowers ever wilt.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Grand Princess Arahaelth Tundrak.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Crude Ogren Helmet", "A rather large helm, donned with spikes and\ngruesom decor!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Belgisiz.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Bitter Ale", "Adding a fruity ingredient to pale ale\nwill improve on it's taste.\nWith carrots, it becomes bitter.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Lion's Cane", "An incredibly fancy walking cane lies in your\nhand. The staff would be made of finely\npolished wood, plated in a thin layer of\ngold. The bottom would be made of silver,\ncapable of resting firmly upon most surfaces.\nThe head was a piece of art, made nearly\nentirely out of gold. It'd represent a lion's\nhead, with red eyes, made of fine, small\nrubies.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Malinor.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Spectical Frames", "Spectical frames without their lens, seem to\nfit for a specific person.", "minecraft:iron_bars", ""),
        StaticItem("Principality Passport", "OFFICIAL PRINCIPALITY PASSPORT: ACCEPTED BY\nLORD LAEN DRAKON; [Name: Edhelas Endoriell]\n[Race: Snow Elf] [Eye Color: Blue] [Hair\nColor: White] [Weight: 190] [Height: 6'4]\nBorn Citizen.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [High Chancellor] Laen Drakon.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of the Windswept Druid", "A lengthy staff of 5'5\", its head a mass of\nleafless branches curled to the left. Small\ntrinkets dangle from the branches, clinking\ntogether and producing small chimes as the\nwind weaves through them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LeoWarrior14.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Uriel Necklace", "A brilliant and beautiful gem, encrusted\nwithin a pristine clasp with various\nengravings lining the metallic linings of the\ngem. Crafted and worked upon by the finest\njewelers, the family relic emits a softened\nglow when held within the hands of a specific\nindividual, seemingly able to identify and\nresonate with harmony within her presence.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Uriel Dynasty.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Welfsbane", "A beautifully carved bow of wood of a bluish\ntint, it is used ceremonially in the Grand\nPrincedom of the Mali'fenn by the royal\nfamily of Tundrak. Inlaid is small, carved\nthanhium sigils marking that it was made by\nSerelia Iheiuhii'ante, and to be used only by\nthe Grand Prince.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Serelia Iheiuhii'ante.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("StickBall Ball", "A round, white ball that is generally larger\nthan one's palms and will likely hurt if hit\nby it. This Ball would be marked with the\nOffical Warhawke Ball Mark. Leyu'celia™", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Stickball Bat", "This would be a strong club, finely crafted\nto be weighted to the front. It'd be well\nrounded, aswell as marked with the offical\nWarhawke StickBall Mark. Leyu'celia™", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Milk", "A warm mug of chocolate milk\nis heaven on cold Snow Maiden's nights.", "minecraft:milk_bucket", ""),
