        StaticItem("Pea Soup", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice Blade", "A 'cool' weapon. The sword's blade is made of\npure ice, the translucent blue ice shimmers\nin the light. It never melts, never dulls and\nis just as sharp as any other sword.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Anadunae.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
